<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 LUKER</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk mukwongo Pa Luker</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Luker</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk mukwongo pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKER</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man mukwongo pa Luker kicoyo pi tito kit ma ker pa Luicrael obedo kakube kwede kun kubu tekwarogi kit malube ki coc ma ceng kicoyo i Buk pa Camuel. Dong buk man kitwero pokone i dul adek mapatpat: (1) Lok me acakine tito kit ma Solomon wod pa Daudi ocamo kwede ker macalo laloc me Icrael ki me Juda, ki to pa wone Daudi. (2) Me aryone tito pi loc pa Solomon kacel ki jami ducu ma en obedo ki kero me tiyo. Atikane en aye gedo Ot pa Lubanga madit ma nen mwonya tutwal i Jerucalem. (3) Me adeke tito kit ma ker me Icrael opoke kwede i dul aryo ma dongo; ker me tung kupiny (Juda), ki ker ma tung kumalo (Icrael), ki kit kwayi lok ikom jo ducu ma gubedo luloc kun gitelo lobo Icrael i yo me loc nio wa ikine ka mwaka alip acel ki miya abongwen nono ma pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">I buk pa Luker me acel ki Luker me aryo, laloc acel acel kingolo kop i wiye kun lubu kit ma en otiyo maber kwede bot Lubanga, ka bene kit tela maber ma en otiyo pi lobone ci man gire nen kun lube ki gin mabeco ma okati ki i tic meno. Woro cal jogi ki kwero bedo lawiny bot Rwot Lubanga ki tung cel kono kelo mere can malit. Ento luloc me Icrael i ker me tung kumalo pole gurweny woko ki inyim Rwot ite atema macalo man, kadi bed luloc me Juda gin ticgi gurubu aruba maber ki maracune bene.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jo ma gingene pi ticgi matego dok mabeco bot lwak i buk man pa Luker me acel en aye obedo Lunebi pa Rwot, gin gubedo katito lok pa Rwot kun gijuku dano ni pe guwor cal apaya ka dok bene pe gujem ikom Lubangagi. Atikane dano macalo Eliya ki kit ma en oloyo kwede ajwaki pa Baal tye i coc me cura 18 me buk man.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma Daudi ogiko kwede loc mere i lobo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-2:12">1:1—2:12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon odoko laloc manyen i lobo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 2:13-46">2:13-46</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma loc pa Solomon obedo kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 3:1-11:43">3:1—11:43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Acaki me loc pa Solomon <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 3:1-4:34">3:1—4:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Gedo Ot pa Rwot otum <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 5:1-8:66">5:1—8:66</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Kare me agiki me loc pa Solomon <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 9:1-11:43">9:1—11:43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ker opoke iye aryo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-22:53">12:1—22:53</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Jemo pa lukaka me kumalo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-14:20">12:1—14:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Luloc me Juda ki Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 14:21-16:34">14:21—16:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Lanebi Eliya <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 17:1-19:21">17:1—19:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Rwot Akab me Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 20:1-22:40">20:1—22:40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Rwot Yekocapat me Juda ki Ajaria me Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 22:41-53">22:41-53</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Daudi ikare me tiyone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Ikare meno Daudi laloc madit me lobo Icrael onongo dong otii tutwal, kadi bed lutice gium kome ki lwak bongo um ma kidodo mapol ikome, ci pe winyo lyeto mo wa ki acel ikome. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Ka lutice guneno man gudok iye bote ni, “Ladit rwoda, wek kiyeny nyako mo matidi ma peya obutu ki laco kikel boti, wek obut kacel kwedi omur kori, ogwoki bene, ladit rwot, ci omiyi lyeto.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Ci kiyenyo nyako mo matidi ma mwonya ki i lobo Icrael ducu, ci gunongo Abicagi anyira Cunam, gukele bot Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Nyako meno onongo mwonya mada. En nyakonu otugi doko lagwok rwot cut, kun tiyo tic ducu; ento rwot pe oloko odoko dakone.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adoniya oete i ker</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:4">2 Cam 3:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Adoniya ma mine Kagit ceng onywale bot Daudi ongwete pi dit wiye kene kun waco ni an, “Abibedo rwot me Icrael.” Ci oyubu gadigadi lweny ki wegi aguragura, ki dano pyere abic, oketogi me ringo inyime. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Yam wone onongo peya ocoke ikare mo keken, nyo pi penye ni, “Pingo itimo kuman onyo itiyo gin munyoni!” En odongo nia wa i tinone makome mwonya mada ma neno mit; yam mine onywale olubu nge Abcalom. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya opiro lok ki Joab wod pa Jeruya ki ajwaka Abiatar, ci gulubu kor Adoniya kun gukonye i yub mere me leyo loc ki bot wone. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Ento ajwaka Jadok, Benaya wod pa Yekoyada, lanebi Natan, Cimei, Rei ki oteka lweny pa Daudi yam pe gitye tung bot Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adoniya otyero romi ki twoni ki lee ma gucwe bot Lubanga inyim got Twol matye inget En-rogel, ka olwongo iye omegine ducu ma awobe pa wone Daudi ki ludito abembem ducu ma i ker me Juda ma gitiyo bot rwot. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Ento pe olwongo lanebi Natan, kadi Benaya, kadi twoni oteka lweny pa Daudi, kadi wa omine Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:24">2 Cam 12:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Natan owaco bot Batceba min Solomon ni, “In peya iwinyo ni Adoniya wod pa Kagit otyeko wire me doko laloc me Icrael ma rwotwa Daudi bene pe ngeyo lok mo iye? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Eyo, kong dong ia ibin kany wek amiyi lok me ryeko, ka wek alar kwoni ki kwo pa wodi Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Cit oyot bot rwotwa Daudi, iwace ni, ‘Yam ikwongo kwong bota, ladit, kun iwaco ni, woda Solomon aye bicamo keri, en aye bibedo iwi komkeri. Pingo Adoniya aye tin odoko rwot?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Ikare ma nongo pud itye kalok ki rwot, an bene abibino i kori kamoko loki ni tye ada.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Batceba oa ocito bot rwot wa i kicikane. Onongo rwot dong otii tutwal, kun Abicagi anyira Cunam obedo kamiyo kony ma mite ikome. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Ka Batceba obino bot rwot ci en okulu wiye kun ryebe piny me woro cware. Ci Daudi openye ni, “Gin ango ma cwinyi mitoni?” <verse eid="1KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Ci Batceba ogamo ni, “Rwoda, yam ikwongo kwong bota ki nying Rwot Lubangani kun iwaco ni, ‘Solomon ma woda aye bicamo keri, en aye bibedo iwi komkeri.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Kombedi nen ba, Adoniya aye dong odoko rwot, kadi bed in rwoda pe ingeyo iye gin mo. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />En otyeko tyero twoni ki lee ma ocwegu ki lwak romi mapol tutwal, ka dok olwongo awobe pa rwot mukeneni ducu, ki ajwaka Abiatar, ki Joab ladit me mony bene; ento pe olwongo latici Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Ka dong lok tye kuman Rwoda, kombedi wang jo Icrael ducu gineno boti pi tito botgi ngat ma bibedo iwi komkeri ka in dong i peke. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Gwok nyo kare biromo ma nongo in rwoda dong i to woko, iywe kacel ki kwariwu, ci an ki woda Solomon aye kibinenowa macalo wan lubal!”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Ikare ma Batceba tye kalok ki rwot, lanebi Natan bene obino i ot. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Lukur rwot guloko bote; kun giwace ni rwot, “Lanebi Natan bene tye kany.” Ka Natan odonyo i ot, ci oryebe inyim rwot kun okulu wiye piny me wore. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Lacen Natan oloko bote kuman ni, “Rwoda Daudi, onongo in mono ceng iwaco ni, ‘Adoniya aye bileyo ka tyeni, en aye bibedo iwi komkeri?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Gin ma omiyo apenyo man en aye ni, en dong ocito woko, otyero twoni ki lee ma ocwegu, ki romi mapol tutwal, dok olwongo awobe pa rwot mukeneni ducu, ki Joab ladit me mony, ki ajwaka Abiatar. Nen, gin ducu gitye kacam ki mat inyime kun giwaco ni, ‘Rwot Adoniya obed kwo nakanaka!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Ento an ma latici, ajwaka Jadok, Benaya wod pa Yekoyada, ki latici Solomon, en pe olwongowa. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Lok man in rwoda Daudi aye imiyo otime bo, kun bene pe itito botwa wan lutici anga ma bibedo iwi komkeri ka in dong i peke?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Rwot Daudi ogamo ni. “Lwong Batceba obin bota.” Ci Batceba obino bot rwot, ka ocung inyime. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Daudi dok okwonge kun waco ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, mayam okoko kwona ki i cing lukwora, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />macalo yam bene akwongo kwong boti ki nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael kun awaco ni, ‘Wodi Solomon aye bileyo katyena, en aye bibedo iwi komkera me leyo kakara,’ tin atina dong abiketo i tic.” <verse eid="1KI 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Ci Batceba okulu wiye ka oryebe piny pi woro rwot ka ocako lok kun waco ni, “Myero rwoda rwota Daudi obed kwo kun rii nakanaka!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Ka dok Rwot Daudi owaco ni, “Wulwong ajwaka Jadok obin bota, ki Benaya wod pa Yekoyada.” Ci gin gubino bot rwot. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Ci rwot owaco botgi ni, “Wucit ki acikarina, wuket woda Solomon iwi kanana kikome, ci wutere cok ki wang it ma i Gikon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Ki kunu wumii ajwaka Jadok ki lanebi Natan guwire ki moo me bedo rwot me Icrael ki lobo Juda, ka lacen wukut tum kun wuwaco ni, ‘Rwot Solomon obed kwo nakanaka!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Ka wun dong wubilubu kore, ka en bibino ci bibedo iwi komkera; pien en aye bibedo rwot ma leyo kakara, an dong atyeko keto en me bedo laloc iwi Icrael ki iwi Juda bene.” <verse eid="1KI 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Ci Benaya wod pa Yekoyada ogamo dog rwot ni, “Amen! Myero Rwot Lubangani, rwoda rwot omok lok man ma iwaconi. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Kit ma Rwot yam obedo kwedi, rwoda Daudi, en dok obed ki Solomon bene kitmeno, omii komkere obed dit makato meri.”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Ajwaka Jadok, lanebi Natan, Benaya wod pa Yekoyada, ki jo Keret ki jo Pelet, gucito guketo Solomon obedo iwi kana pa wone Daudi, ka gukele kwede ki iwang it ma i Gikon. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Ci ajwaka Jadok okwanyo moo ma i tung romo ma onongo con tye i kema pa Rwot, owiro ki Solomon ki kunu. Lacen gukutu tum, ci lwak ducu gugamo ni, “Rwot Solomon obed kwo nakanaka!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Dano gucako mol i kore kun gikutu nyamulere ma cwinygi yom adada, ma ngom yenge pi dwon gi.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adoniya ki welene ducu inge tyeko karamagi guwinyo wo licu i dye taun madit. Ka Joab owinyo dwon tum ci openyo ni. “Woo madit ma i taun madit nyutu gin ango?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Ikare ma en pud tye kalok, Yonacan wod pa ajwaka Abiatar otuc, ci Adoniya owace ni. “Dony, pien in dano ma kigeno, man nongo i kelo lok maber.” <verse eid="1KI 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Ento Yonacan ogamo dog Adoniya ni, “Pe kumeno, ladit, pien Rwoda rwotwa Daudi dong otyeko keto Solomon me bedo rwot. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />En otyeko cwalo ajwaka Jadok, lanebi Natan, Benaya wod pa Yekoyada, jo Keret, jo Pelet, ci guketo Solomon obedo iwi kana pa rwot. <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Ajwaka Jadok ki lanebi Natan gutyeko wire ki moo i Gikon me bedo rwot; gucito nia ki kunu ma cwinygi yom, en aye omiyo wo tye i taun madit. Man aye dwon ma wuwinyoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Solomon dong obedo iwi komker, <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />dok bene lutic pa rwot gucito ka pwoyo rwotwa, rwoda Daudi, kun giwaco ni, ‘Lubangani omii nying Solomon oywek mada makato meri, dok omii komkere obed dit makato komkeri!’ Ci Daudi okule piny iwi kitandane, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />ka owaco bene ni, ‘Kipwo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, ma otyeko keto ngat acel ki ikin lutinona obedo iwi komkera tin, ma kun aneno ki wanga.’”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Ci lwak wele pa Adoniya ducu komgi ocako myel, ci gutware ki kunu ma ngat acel acel okemo yone kene. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Adoniya ocako lworo Solomon, ci oa ocito, omako ten keno me keno tyer matye i kema pa Rwot. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Kitito pire bot Solomon kun kiwaco ni, “Nen, Adoniya dong lwori, rwot Solomon, pien ocito omako ten keno me keno tyer matye i kema pa Rwot kun waco ni, ‘Wang ma rwot Solomon okwongo kwong bota ni pe ebineka, an latice, ki pala lucwan, ci abia ki kany.’” <verse eid="1KI 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Solomon ogamo loke kuman kun waco ni, “Ka en bibedo dano ma gene, ci yer wiye mo pe bipoto piny; ento ka rac mo onen ikome, ci en bito.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Kitmeno rwot ocwalo dano ci gukwanyo Adoniya woko ki ikom keno tyer, ci ocito oworo rwot Solomon, ci Solomon owaco bote ni, “Cit i odi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ociko Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Ka kare me to pa Daudi dong onyiko cok ci en ociko Solomon ki lok magi: <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“An dong acok to woko. Bed dano matek, dok i cam co. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Mak cik pa Rwot Lubangani kun iwoto i yone, ma kun ilubu lok ducu ma en ociko, dok bene gin ducu ma ceng en omiyo botwa wek obed lok me caden, ikit ma kicoyo kwede i buk pa Moses, wek ibed ki gum ikom gin ducu ma itiyo, ki kama idok iye ducu. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Rwot omok loke ducu mayam oloko ikomi, ma owaco ni. ‘Kace awobeni gibigwoko kitgi maber, kun gibedo dano ma gin lugen inyima ki cwinygi ducu, ki tipu komgi ducu, ci pe ibibedo labongo danoni mo ma bibedo iwi komker me loyo lobo Icrael!’<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:27">2 Cam 3:27</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:10">20:10</ref></char>
    </note>Ento in ingeyo gin mayam Joab wod pa Jeruya otiyo ikoma, ki kit ma otimo ki ludito mony pa jo Icrael aryoni. Abneri wod pa Ner ki Amaca wod pa Jeter, ma en ceng onekogi woko pi culu kwor ikare me kuc pi remo mayam oo i dog lweny i mony ca. En oreyo remo pa jo ma gipe ki bal idoga. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Myero in i tim ikome muporo ryekoni; ento pe iwek en oto to tiyo. <verse eid="1KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2 Cam 17:27-29</ref></char></note>Ento inyut cwiny me mar ki awobe pa Barjilai ma jo Gilead, wek gubed ikin dano ma gicamo iwi mejani; gin bene yam gubedo ki mar kweda kumeno ikare ma gunonga ka aringo omeru Abcalom. <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">2 Cam 16:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:16-23">2 Cam 19:16-23</ref> </char></note>Dok gin mukene bene ma pud mite ni i tii iye aye lok ikom Cimei wod pa Gera ma Labenjamin ma ganggi tye i Bakurim. En yam obedo kalamo an ki cen maracu tutwal ikare ma onongo acito i Makanaim; ento ka en ceng obino karwate kweda i dog kulu Jordan, ci akwongo kwong bote ki nying Rwot kun awaco ni, pe abineke ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Eyo, in pe ibedo kwede macalo en pe tye ki bal mo. In laryeko, ibingeyo kit ma ibitime kwede ikare mo i anyim, pien ibingolo to i wiye.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 29:26-30">1 Tek 29:26-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Lacen Daudi oto ma dong otii likong, ci en oywe kacel ki kwarine ki kuc, ci kiyike i taun madit pa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2 Cam 5:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1 Tek 3:4</ref></char></note>Daudi oloyo lobo Icrael pi mwaka pyere angwen; en ocako bedo kaloc i Kebron pi mwaka abiro, ka dok i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere adek wiye adek. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">1 Tek 29:23</ref></char></note>Kitmeno Solomon obedo iwi komker pa wone Daudi, ci kere omoko matek.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Adoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Adoniya wod pa Kagit obino bot Batceba ma en aye min Solomon. Batceba openye ni, “Ibino ki kuc?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Abino ki kuc.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Ka dok owaco ni, “Atye ki gin mo ma amito titi.” Ci Batceba ogamo ni, “Tita do.” <verse eid="1KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya ocako lok kun owaco ni, “Ingeyo ni ker man yam mera, dok jo Icrael guye ni alogi; ento ker dok oloke odoko pa omera, pien onongo Rwot mito kumeno. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />An atye ki lega mo acel ma amito penyi kwede; pe i kwer doga.” Ci Batceba ogamo ni, “Tita gin ma itye kamitone do.” <verse eid="1KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:3-4">1 Luk 1:3-4</ref> </char></note>Ci Adoniya owace ni. “Alegi ipenya rwot Solomon, pien angeyo ni en pe bikwero dogi, wek en omiya Abicagi ma Lacunam obed dakona.” <verse eid="1KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batceba ogamo ni, “Ber matek; abitito lok man bot rwot.” <verse eid="1KI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Ci Batceba ocito katito lega pa Adoniya bot rwot Solomon. Solomon oa malo pi jolo mine, okule piny bot mine; ka odok obedo iwi komkere, ka dok olwongo kikelo kom pi min rwot bene, ci en obedo tung acuc. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Ka Batceba ocako owaco bot rwot ni, “Atye ki lega mo acel ma amito penyi kwede; pe i kwer.” Ci Solomon ogamo doge ni, “Wac legani nu, maa; pien pe abikwero lok dogi.” <verse eid="1KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Ci mine owaco ni, “Wek Abicagi ma Lacunami kimii bot Adoniya obed dakone.” <verse eid="1KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Ci rwot Solomon odoke iye ni, “Pingo ilego ni amii Abicagi ma Lacunam bot Adoniya? Leg bene wa pi kera ducu do; pien en omera madite, en gire con onongo tye ki cwak pa ajwaka Abiatar ki Joab wod pa Jeruya mayam gucung kangete wek ebed rwot.” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Ci rwot Solomon okwongo kwong matek ki nying Rwot kun waco ni, “Lubanga oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato kace pi lok man pe amiyo Adoniya oculu ki kwone! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Kombedi, macalo Rwot tye makwoni, ma dong omoko kera, ma oketa iwi komker pa wora Daudi, ma oketa adoko rwot, dok omiyo jo me oda gucung matek kit mayam ociko ni, Adoniya tin ma ceng pud pe opoto kibinekone woko.” <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Cut rwot Solomon ocwalo Benaya wod pa Yekoyada ki twero me lubu kor Adoniya, ci Benaya lawi mony ocito ocobo Adoniya ki tong oreto piny, oneko woko.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiryemo Abiatar ka kineko Joab woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1 Cam 22:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:24">2 Cam 15:24</ref></char>
    </note> Rwot Solomon owaco bot ajwaka Abiatar ni, “Cit i Anatot, i paconi, pien in imyero ki to. Ento peya abineki ikare ni, pien yam ibedo katingo Canduk pa Rwot Lubanga inyim wora Daudi, dok pien in bene yam iribe ki wora ikare ma en oneno can madwong.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:27-36">1 Cam 2:27-36</ref></char></note>Ci Solomon okwanyo Abiatar woko ki i tic me bedo ajwaka pa Rwot. Ma omiyo lok pa Rwot mayam oloko i Cilo ma mako jo me ot pa Eli ocobe ka kare.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Ka Joab owinyo gin mutime, ci oringo olaro i Ot Kema pa Rwot, omako ten keno me keno tyer; pien Joab nene onongo obedo kakonyo Adoniya, kadi bed yam pe oye konyo Abcalom ikare ca ma oete ikom wone Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Ka kitito pire bot rwot Solomon ni nen, “Joab oringo olaro i Kema pa Rwot, tye wa i kanget keno tyer,” Ci Solomon ocwalo Benaya wod pa Yekoyada kun waco ni, “Cit i cobe i rete woko piny.” <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Ci Benaya ocito i Kema pa Rwot, owace ni, “Rwot Solomon ociko ni ikat woko.” Ento Joab ogamo ni, “Pe, abito ki kany.” Ci Benaya odwoko lok ma Joab owaco bot rwot.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Solomon odok iye bote ni, “Tim kit ma en owaco ni, cobe i rete woko piny. Ci ibiyike woko, wek kikwany alii woko ki ikoma ki ikom ot pa wora pi remo pa dano mayam Joab onekogi labongo bal mo ma gin gutimo. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Rwot bidwoko tim me oyo remo meno i wiye kikome, pien en yam opoto ikom twoni oteka lwenywa aryo ma cwinygi atir ma gibeco gikato en, ci onekogi woko ma wora Daudi pe ngeyo en aye Abneri wod pa Ner ma lawimony maloyo mony pa jo Icrael, ki Amaca wod pa Jeter ma lawimony maloyo mony pa jo Juda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Alii me togi bidok iwi en Joab ki iwi likwaye matwal; ento ki bot Daudi ki bot likwaye ki jo me ode ducu, ki bot komkere, kuc ma a ki bot Rwot bibedo iye nakanaka.” <verse eid="1KI 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Ci Benaya wod pa Yekoyada ocito kunu, ocobo Joab oreto piny oneko woko; ci kiyike i pacone kikome matye i dye tim aroo me Juda. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Ka rwot ocako keto Benaya wod pa Yekoyada me bedo ladit maloyo mony ma ka Joab, ka dok oketo Jadok me bedo ajwaka pa Lubanga ma ka Abiatar.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Lacen rwot ocwalo kwena me lwongo Cimei bote, ka owaco bote ni, “Ger odi piri keni i Jerucalem, ibed iye kunu, pe ia ki kunu icit i kabedo mo mukene. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Ento inino mo keken ma ibia icito iye woko keni, ma ibingolo iye nota ora Kidron, ci myero i nge atir ni ibito pimeno; alii me toni bidok gire iwii.” <verse eid="1KI 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Cimei ogamo dog rwot ni, “Lok ma iwaconi ber, rwoda rwot; abitimo kit ma iwaconi.” Ci Cimei obedo i Jerucalem pi kare malac.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Ka mwaka adek okato, ci opii aryo pa Cimei guringo woko wa bot Akic wod pa Maaka, ma laloc me Gat. Ka kitito bot Cimei ni, “Opiini gitye i Gat bot Akic,” <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />ci Cimei oa, otweyo kom me bedo inge kanane, ci ocito i Gat bot Akic kayenyo kor opiine. Ka Cimei onongogi, ci odwokogi cen. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Ka kitito lok man bot Solomon ni Cimei otyeko a woko ki i Jerucalem, ocito wa i Gat ka oloke odwogo, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />ci rwot ocwalo dano kalwongo Cimei, ci owaco bote ni, “Yam pe amiyo ikwongo kwong i nying Rwot, kun ajuki matek ma awaco ni, ‘nge atir ni, inino ma i bicito iye woko i kabedo mo mukene, ibito?’ Ci in igamo doga ni, ‘Lok ma iwaconi ber; abilubu.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Ci pingo nene pe dong igwoko kwongi ma i kwongo inyim Rwot, ki cik mayam aciki kwede?” <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Rwot Solomon dok owaco bot Cimei ni, “In ingeyo ki i cwinyi kit tim maracu ducu mayam itimo ikom wora Daudi; Rwot bene bidwoko timi ducu maracu meno poto iwii kikome. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Ento an abibedo ki gum, ki komker pa Daudi bimoko matwal inyim Rwot.” <verse eid="1KI 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Ka dong rwot dok ociko Benaya wod pa Yekoyada; ci okato woko ocobo Cimei oreto piny oneko woko. Kitmeno ker omoko matek i cing rwot Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon onyomo nya pa Parao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Solomon ceng oribe ki Parao laloc me Ejipt ka lacen en dok onyomo nyare; ci otero nya pa Parao i taun madit pa Daudi nio ka dong otyeko gero ode kikome ki Ot pa Rwot, ki cel ma orumu Jerucalem. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Ento lwak gire gubedo katyero gitum i kabedo me woro Lubanga ma iwi godi, pien onongo peya kigero ot mo pi nying Rwot Lubanga.<verse eid="1KI 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomon olego pi ryeko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:1-13">2 Tek 1:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomon yam omaro Rwot Lubanga, kun lubu cik pa wone Daudi, en onongo pud tumu gitum dok wango odok eceta i kabedo me woro Lubanga matye iwi godi. <verse eid="1KI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Inino mo acel Solomon ocito i Gibeon pi tumu gitum kunu, pien meno aye yam obedo kabedo madite me woro Lubanga. Inino meno Solomon otyero gitum awanga alip acel kulu iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Ka Solomon pud tye i Gibeon, Rwot Lubanga onyute bote iwang lek i dyewor, ci owace ni, “Peny gin ma imito ki bota.” <verse eid="1KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Ci Solomon ogamo dog Rwot ni, “In yam inyutu mar meri madwong ma pe loke bot wora Daudi ma latici, pien obedo ka kwo inyimi ki gen madwong ki tim ma atir, ma cwinye leng; in bene igwoko mar meri madit ma pe loke pire, dok bene ityeko miyo wode obedo iwi komkere i kareni. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Ai Rwot Lubanga, kombedi dong iketa, an latici, adoko rwot ma ka wora Daudi, kadi bed pud an latin, ma peya angeyo loyo dano. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />An dong atye ikin joni mayam iyerogi, rok madit ma pe kwane, ma welgi bene pe ngene pi polgi. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Ber in Rwot i miya cwiny me ryeko me loyo lwaki, wek ange poko kin gin maber ki gin marac; anga mono matwero loyo rok man maditi?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Ci Rwot cwinye obedo yom ikom Solomon pi gin ma en olego. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Lubanga dok owaco bote ni, “Pien ilego gin ma kit man, ma kun bene pe ilega ni amii irii iwi lobo nakanaka, pe bene ilego pi lonyo, kadi pi kwo pa lumeroki, ento ilego ni kimii cwiny me ryeko ki me poko gin matye atir, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />abitiyo kit ma ilegoni. Nen, dong atyeko mini ryeko ki cwiny me poko kin lok mapatpat ikit rwom ma peya onen ikom dano mo nia wa con, dok bene ngat mo macalo in pe binen ki i ngeyi. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Dok abimini gin ma pe ilego pire bene, abimini lonyo ki deyo, wek rwot mo pe obinen ma kibiporo ki in pi kwoni ducu. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Kace ibilubu yona kun i mako cika ki lok ma aciko ducu, kit mayam woru Daudi olubuni, ci abimedo mwaka me kwoni weko i rii iwi lobo kare malac.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Ka Solomon oco, ci onongo ni kara ebedo ka leko lek. Ka dong obino i Jerucalem, en ocung inyim Canduk me Gigike pa Rwot, ka dok otyero gitum awanga ki gityer lakwe cwiny, ci otedo karama pi lutice ducu.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon ongolo kop ki ryeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Inino mo acel mon aryo ma lukwele gubino bot rwot Solomon, ci gucung inyime pi ngolo kop. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Dako acel owaco ni, “Ai rwoda, dako man ki an wabedo i ot acel, ci an anywalo latina ma onongo en tye i ot kweda. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Dok inge nino me adek cake ikare ma agonye kwede, en bene onywal; dano mo onongo pe tye kwedwa i ot meno, ento onongo watye wan aryo keken. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Ci dako man obutu ikom latine i dyewor, omiyo latin oto. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />En oa malo ki i dyewor, ci otingo woda woko ki kangeta; ma onongo an anino woko ci opyele i kabutune, ka dok opyelo kom wode muto ni i kabutuna. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Ka oo odiko, ci aa malo ka doto latina; ci nen, anongo dong oto woko, ma abedo ka ngiyo kome, ci nen anongo ni, pe en aye latina ma anywaloni.” <verse eid="1KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Ento dako lawoteni waco ni, “Pe kumeno; latin makwoni: aye mera, latin mutoni meri.” Dako mukwongoni odoke iye ni, “Pe, latin mutoni aye meri, latin makwoni aye mera.” Gubedo kalok kumeno inyim rwot.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Ka rwot dok owaco bot mon meno ni, “Ngat man waco ni, ‘Man makwoni aye latina, latini en mutoni;’ ci mukene gamo ni. ‘Pe; ento mutoni aye latini, makwoni aye mera.’” <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Ci rwot dok olwongo latice acel ci owace ni, “Kela pala lucwan.” Ci ki kelo pala lucwan inyim rwot. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Cut rwot ociko latice acel ni, “Kipok i latin makwo ni aryo, wek ki mi dul acel bot dako acel, ki dulle tungcel bot lawote.” <verse eid="1KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Ci dako ma wode tye makwoni owaco bot rwot ni, “Ai, rwoda, mi latin makwoni bote, pe i nek aneka!” Pien cwinye ocwer pi latine. Ento mukeneni ogamoni, “Pe ki pok iye wek pe dong obed mera nyo meri.” <verse eid="1KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Lacen rwot ogamo lokgi kun waco ni, “Mi latin makwoni bot dako mukwongoni. Pe kinek woko, en aye min latin meno.” <verse eid="1KI 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Ka jo Icrael guwinyo kit kop ma rwot ongoloni, ci gubedo ki woro madit ikom rwot; pien guniang ada ni ryeko pa Lubanga me poko lok onong tye i iye, pimeno omiyo en ongolo kop ma atir.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ludito wi tic pa Solomon ki lulo dul lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Solomon obedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Dano magi aye gubedo ludito wi lutice:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 4:2">Ajaria wod pa Jadok en ceng tye ajwaka pa Lubanga; <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Elikorep ki Akija ma gin awobe pa Cica gubedo lukarani; Yekocapat wod pa Akilud obedo laco lok ma time; <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya wod pa Yekoyada obedo ladit me mony; Jadok ki Abiatar aye gubedo ajwaki pa Lubanga; <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Ajaria wod pa Natan aye obedo ladit maloyo lulo dul lobo; ka Jabud wod pa Natan obedo ajwaka ki larem rwot; <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Akica obedo ladit maloyo lutic ma gwoko gangkal; ki Adoniram wod pa Abda obedo ladit maloyo tic muroni.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Solomon obedo ki lulo dul lobo apar wiye aryo ma giloyo wi Luicrael ducu, ma ticgi obedo me coko cam pi rwot ki jone ducu; dano acel acel miyo cam matwero tyeko dwe acel i mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Nyinggi en aye: Ben-kur onongo loyo lobo godi me Epraim; <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Ben-deker onongo loyo Makaj, Caalbim, Bet-cemec ki Elon-bet-kanan; <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Ben-keced oloyo Arubot ki Coko ki lobo Keper ducu; <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Ben-abinadab oloyo Napat-dor ducu. (Onongo dakone obedo Tapat ma nya pa Solomon.) <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana wod pa Akilud oloyo Taanak, Megiddo ki Bet-cean ducu matye kanget Jaretan ma i lung me Jejreel, ki cake i Bet-cean nio i Abel-mekola ki nio kwede wa kanget Jokmeam tungcel; <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Ben-geber oloyo Ramot-gilead, ki taun matino pa Jair wod pa Manace ma gitye i lobo Gilead, kacel ki lobo Argob ma i Bacan matye iye taun madito pyere abicel ma kicelo ki cel, ma dogcelgi kicego ki rii nyonyo bronze; <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Akinadab wod pa Iddo oloyo Makanaim; <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Akimaj oloyo lobo Naputali. En onongo ceng bene onyomo Bacemat ma nya pa Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana wod pa Kucai oloyo Acer ki Bealot; <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yekocapat wod pa Parua oloyo lobo Icakar; <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Cimei wod pa Ela oloyo lobo Benjamin; <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Geber wod pa Uri oloyo dul lobo Gilead mayam obedo lobo pa Cikon rwot pa Jo Amor ki pa Og rwot me Bacan. Dok onongo tye lalo lobo acel maloyo lobo Juda.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo ikare me loc pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Jo Juda ki jo Icrael yam gidwong adada marom ki kweyo ma i dog nam; gubedo kacam ki kamat ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Aca 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:26">2 Tek 9:26</ref></char></note>Solomon obedo kaloyo ker mapatpat ducu cake ki i kulu Euprate nio wa i lobo pa jo Piliciti, ki nio wa i lobo Ejipt. Jo me ker meno gubedo katyero mot bot Solomon kun gitiyo bote ikare me kwone ducu.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Cam ma kimiyo bot Solomon pi nino acel acel onongo romo moko kwon mapwote guniya miya acel, moko kwon mukene guniya miya aryo, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />twoni mucwe apar, dyangi pyere aryo ma kikwayogi i olet, romi miya acel, ma pe iribo iye til ki bure ki abur, ki gweni mucwe. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />En onongo bwoyo lobo ducu ma tung kupotoceng cake i kulu Euprate, kun cake ki i Tipica nio wa i Gaja, kun loyo ki luker ducu cake ki i kulu Euprate odok kwede tung kupotoceng; en bene obedo ki kuc i kabedo ducu murumu lobone. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Ikare meno Juda ki Icrael bene gubedo mot ki kuc cake ki i Dan nio kwede wa i Beer-ceba, kun dano acel acel bedo gire ite oloke ki ite odurune ikare me loc pa Solomon ducu. <verse eid="1KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">1 Luk 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:14">2 Tek 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:25">9:25</ref></char></note>Solomon obedo ki kabedo me gwoko aguragurane ma kiromo gwoko iye aguragura alip pyere angwen pi ywayo gadigadine me lweny, ki lulweny alip apar wiye aryo ma giringo ki aguragura. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Lulo dul lobo mapatpat gubedo kamiyo cam bot rwot Solomon ki bene pi jo ducu ma gicito kacam bote, kun dano acel acel miyo i dwene; ci pe gumiyo gin mo orem. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Ki reng cayiri bene ki reng ngano pi cam pa aguragura ki pi aguragura mukene ma gidwire kitero ducu i kabedo ma kimitogi iye, kun ngat acel acel kelo kit ma kiciko.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Lubanga omiyo Solomon obedo ki ryeko ki niang matut mada; tame lac marom ki kweyo ma oyare i dog nam. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Kitmeno ryeko pa Solomon okato ryeko pa jo ducu mayam gitye tung kunyango, wa ki ryeko pa jo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89">Jab 89</ref></char></note>En onongo ryek makato jo mukeneni ducu, en obedo laryeko makato Etan ma jo Jera, ki Eman, ki Kalkol ki Darda ma gin awobe pa Makol; ci nying Solomon oywek oromo i rok ducu ma orumugi. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:1">Car 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:1">10:1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25:1">25:1</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 1:1">Wer 1:1</ref></char></note>En bene obolo carolok maromo alip adek; ki wer ma en ceng ocako romo alip acel ki nyige abic. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Oloko ikom yadi kun ocako ki ikom yat cedar matye i Lebanon nio kwede wa ikom anyero ma twi dongo ikom cel got; oloko bene wa ikom lee tim, ki ikom winyogu, ki ikom gin ma lakalaka ki pinygu, ki ikom recgu. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Ci lwak dano ma i rok ducu gubino ikare ma guwinyo pi ryeko pa Solomon, ki dong lwak mapol gua ki bot luker mukene ma iwi lobo wek gibiwiny ki itgi dok ginen kit ryeko man pirgi ken gi.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon oyube me gero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2 Tek 2:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Kiram laloc me Turo ocwalo lutice bot Solomon ikare ma owinyo ni kiwire ki moo me bedo rwot ma oleyo katyen wone, pien Kiram obedo ki mar madit ikom Daudi nia wa con. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Ci Solomon ocwalo lok bot Kiram ni, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Ingeyo ni wora Daudi pe yam ogero Ot pi nying Rwot Lubangane, pien pol kare obedo kalweny ki mony pa lumerok ma gurume omiyo gerone oloye, nio ka Rwot omiyo en oloyogi ducu. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Ento i kareni Rwot Lubanga dong omiya yweyo i kabedo ducu; i kareni lamonewa mo dong peke, kadi wa peko mo. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Cam 7:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1 Tek 17:11-12</ref></char></note>Pieno omiya atamo pi gero Ot pi nying Rwot Lubangana, kit mayam Rwot owaco bot wora Daudi ni, ‘Wodi ma abiketo i komkeri aye bigero Ot pi nyinga.’ <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Eyo in, dong icik pi tonga lwak yadi cedar me Lebanon. Lutica bene gibiribe ki lutici, ci an abiculi lim me mucara pa lutici kit ma iyubu; pien ingeyo maber ni pe tye dano mo ma ikinwa ma ngeyo tongo yadi macalo jo Cidon.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Ka Kiram owinyo lok pa Solomon, ci loke okweyo cwinye matek tutwal, ci owaco ni, “Kipak Rwot Lubanga ikare man, ma dong omiyo bot Daudi wode ma laryeko me bedo lalo roke man madit tutwali.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Kiram dok ocwalo lok bot Solomon kun waco ni, “Atyeko winyo kwenani ma i cwalo bota; an atye ma atere atera pi tiyo gin ducu ma imito ikom lok ma dok kom bao yat cedar ki bao yat ciprec. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Lutica aye bikelogi i dog nam nia ki i Lebanon; ka dong wabitweyogi kacel ci ki kwangogi iwi pii macalo bwoda nio i kabedo ma ibinyuta, ka dong wabigonyo kin gi woko ka in dong ibigamogi ki kunu; ci ibimiya cam pi jo ma i oda kit ma abimito kwede.” <verse eid="1KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Kiram ocwalo lwak bao cedar ki ciprec bot Solomon kit ma en mitoni, <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />ci Solomon omiyo bot Kiram ngano ma nyige maromo guniya alip pyere abicel me acama pa jone ma i ode, ki moo nyig jeituni ma ki odo maromo debe alip pyere angwen. Solomon obedo kamiyo jami magi ducu bot Kiram mwaka ki mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Rwot obedo kamiyo ryeko bot Solomon kit mayam ocike kwede; ci kuc obedo ikin Kiram ki Solomon; gin aryoni guketo gicike ikin gi.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Ci rwot Solomon ocako nongo muroni pi tiyo tic matek i lobo Icrael ducu; ci ki rono<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fk">Rono </char> i leb Acoli te loke gonye ni nongo dano pi tic muroni. En aye diyo dano me tic tektek labongo cul.</note> dano alip pyere adek pi tic muroni. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:18">1 Luk 12:18</ref></char></note>Ci Solomon ocwalogi i lobo Lebanon, kun cwalogi ki alip aparapar dwe ki dwe kun gi loce aloca i dog ticgi. Gibedo kunu i Lebanon dwe acel, ka dok gibedo i paco tugi dwe aryo; Adoniram en aye obedo ladit maloyo lutic muroni ducu. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Solomon onongo bene tye ki luting yec alip pyere abiro, ki jo ma gipayo godi ma i lobo godi ma giromo alip pyere aboro, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />ka dok imed iye ludito ma giloyo dog tic alip adek ki miya adek ma Solomon oketogi, ma gin lulo lwak ma gitiyo tic. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Gimuku godi ma dongo me wel, kit ma rwot ociko, me keto guti me te ot ki godi ma kipayo mabeco. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Kitmeno lugedo pa Solomon ki pa Kiram, kacel ki jo Gebal, gubedo kapayo godi ki yubu bao ki godi me gero Ot pa Rwot Lubangawa.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon ogero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:1-14">2 Tek 3:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />I nge mwaka miya angwen ki pyere aboro cake ma jo Icrael gua iye ki i lobo Ejipt, i mwaka me angwene me ker pa Solomon ma en tye kaloyo jo Icrael, i dwe Jib, ma en aye dwe me aryone ikit me kwano mwaka pa jo Icrael, en aye obedo kare ma Solomon ocako gero iye Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Ot man ma rwot Solomon ogero pi Rwot Lubanga onongo bore romo mita pyere aryo wiye abiro, ki lace tye mita abongwen ki bore tung malo romo mita apar wiye adek ki nucu. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Kicika ot ma a ki i dogola me donyo, bore romo mita angwen ki nucu, ki lac me kicika ma inyim ot romo mita abongwen, marom ki lac me Kabedo Maleng kikome. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Solomon bene oketo lwak dirica ma lac ki iye ento ding ki tung kuwoko. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />En bene omedo gedo goropwa ma okube adekadek mukene ikom cel ma orumu kwede kicika Ot pa Lubanga ducu tung kungeye ki i butebute. Bor pa goropwa acel acel me cito malo tye puti abiro ki nucu. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Kicika odi ma tino ma pinye lacgi romo puti abiro ki nucu, kicika odi ma idyere lacgi romo puti abongwen, ki me adeke lacgi romo puti apar ki nucu; pien nongo ojwiko kicika ot ki woko kun bwoto kama rii me kicika odi matino butu iye, wek rii pe odony i kicika kor ot kikome.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Ikare ma kigero Ot, kibedo ka gerone ki godi ma kiyubu woko cut ki i bur kama kipayogi iye; ma omiyo ikare ma kitye ka gero Ot pa Lubangani, nyol ki latong ki jami tic ducu me nyonyo pe guwinye iye wa ki acel.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Dogola me donyo i kicika odi matino matye piny onongo tye tung kupiny ka i donyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci kidonyo i goropwa ma idyere kun ki ito ki rwom, ka dok kia ki i goropwa ma idyere ki ito i me adeke. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Kitmeno Solomon ogero ot ci otyeko. Ogoyo dan ot ki rii bao cedar ma kipeto ki bao cedar bene. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Kadok gugero gedo mukene ki woko ma orumu Ot ducu. Goropwane acel acel bore ki malo romo puti abiro ki nucu; ma kikubu ikom ot kikome ki rii bao cedar.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Ikare meno dok Rwot Lubanga olok lok man bot Solomon kun waco ni, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Pi Ot ma itye ka gerone, kace ibilubu cika, kun ilubu kit ma aciko ducu, kun itiyo maber inyima, ci abimiyo loka moko ikin an ki in, kit mayam aloko kwede bot woru Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Dok abibedo ikin jo Icrael, pe abibwoto jona jo Icrael.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jami me i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:1-14">2 Tek 3:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Solomon ogero ot kitmeno ci otyeko. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Ki i ot oguru kor kicika ot ki bao yat cedar, cake ki i dye ot piny nio kwede wa i kwori dan ot; opeto kicika ot me i ot ki bao kumeno, dok opeto dye ot piny ki bao ciprec. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33-34">Nia 26:33-34</ref></char></note> Dong gin gugero kicika ot ma i tyelo ki bao cedar, cake ki i dye ot piny nio kwede wa i kwori dan ot, kun bor me Ot meno romo puti pyere adek. Kigero man ki i ot wek obed Kabedo Maleng ma i tyelo, ma en aye Kabedo Maleng makato ducu. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Ci kicika madite, ma en aye dye ot ma inyim Kabedo Maleng ma i tyeloni, bore romo puti pyere abicel. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Bao cedar ma i ot ki goro iye cal keno munyak ki cal ature. I ot ducu obedo bao cedar keken, ma kom got pe nen. <verse eid="1KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Kiyubu Kabedo Maleng i ot, i tyelo ot kikome, me keto Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Kabedo Maleng ma i tyeloni bore romo puti pyere adek, ki lace puti pyere adek, ki bore tung malo bene romo puti pyere adek; ci gumwono kome woko ducu ki jabu ma kiliyo maber. Ka gutiyo bene keno tyer me bao cedar. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Ci Solomon ociko pire omiyo kimwono i ot woko ki jabu ma kiliyo maber, dok oketo nyor jabu ma ongolo dye ot arii inyim Kabedo Maleng ma i tyelo, ka kimwono kome woko ki jabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Nia 30:1-3</ref></char></note> En oweko kimwono kom ot woko ducu ki jabu, nio ka kom ot ducu otum maber. Ki keno tyer ma i Kabedo Maleng Makato ma i tyelo bene en owaco ni kimwon kome woko ducu ki jabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:18-20">Nia 25:18-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka dok en ociko pi payo cal lukerubi aryo ki yat jeituni, ma kiketogi i Kabedo Maleng Makato ma i tyelo; lakerubi acel acel bore romo puti apar wiye abic. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Ki bwom lakerubi muyare, bwome acel romo puti abiro ki nucu, ki bwome mukene bene romo puti abiro ki nucu; cake ikom lano wi bwome tungcel nio wa i lano wi bwome tung mukene lacgi romo puti apar wiye abic. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Lukerubi aryo ducu bocogi romrom, ki komgi bene rom. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Bor kom lakerubi acel acel romo puti apar wiye abic. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Oketo Lukerubi aryo ducu i kicika ma i tyelo ot, kun bwom lukerubi aryo ducu guyaro woko wek bwom ngat acel ogud kom kicika ot tungcel, ki bwom lakerubi me aryone bene ogud kom kicika ot tung mukeneni; ki bwomgi mukene lano wigi rwate ki i dye ot. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Ci kimwono kom lukerubi woko ki jabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Ogoro cal i kor kicika ot orumu woko ducu, cal lukerubi, cal yadi otit, ki cal ature; ki bene ogoro cal i kor kicika ot ma i tyelo ki kicika madite. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />En ceng oweko kimwono dye ot ducu ki jabu, wa i kicika madite ma i tyelo bene kumeno.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Dogola me donyo i Kabedo Maleng Makato ma i tyelo otiyo kikane aryo ki bao jeituni; rii me dogola ki okar dogola ryoryo ducu gubedo latwoke abic. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />En omiyo kiumu kom kika aryo me bao jeitunini ki cal ma kigoro pa lukerubi, cal yadi otit, ki cal ature. Ka kimwono komgi woko ki jabu, ka olilo jabu ikom cal lukerubi ki ikom cal yadi otit ducu.<verse eid="1KI 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />En bene ceng ociko ni kitii okar dogola me bao jeituni pi dogola me donyo i kicika madite; ma kitiyogi obedo latwoke angwen. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Ka dok kitiyo kika aryo ki bao ciprec; ma kika aryonu ducu gibane abana. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Ogoro cal lukerubi ikomgi, cal yadi otit, ki cal ature. Ka kimwono kom kika woko ki jabu ma kilenyo, ka olilo mapwot ikom cal ma kigoro ikomgini ducu. <verse eid="1KI 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Kigero dyekal ma idyere ki godi apaya latyeng adek, ki bao cedar tyenge acel.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Kiketo guti me Ot pa Rwot Lubanga i mwaka me angwen me loc pa Solomon i lobo Icrael i dwe Jib ma en aye dwe me abic. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Ka dok i mwaka apar wiye acel me loc pa Solomon, i dwe Bul, ma en aye dwe me aboro, en aye kityeko iye tic ikom Ot pa Lubanga ducu, kun onongo lubu kit mayam ki poro kwede. Gerone otero mwaka abiro.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon ogero odi me gang kale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomon lacen doki ocako gero ode kikome ma orii pi mwaka apar wiye adek, ka dong otyeko gero ode ducu kakare.<verse eid="1KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Solomon omiyo kigero ot ma kicako nyinge ni Bunga me Lebanon. Bore romo puti miya acel ki pyere abic, lace romo puti pyere abiro wiye abic, ki bore tung malo romo puti pyere angwen wiye abic; kigero ote ocung iwi lwak wir yat cedar muryeyo latyenge adek, ki rii bao cedar ma kiriyo iwigi. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Dok kiguro bao cedar me umu wi rii ma kiriyo iwi wir pyere angwen wiye abic, ma guryeyo apar wiye abic i tyeng acel acel. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Dok kiketo wang dirica ma guryeyo latyeng adek, kun dirica gikeme ki luwotgi ma guryeyo latyeng adeki. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Dogola ducu ki dirica ducu kitiyogi latwoke angwen, kun dirica kemo dirica wadgi i tyeng adek.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Dok otiyo ot mukene ma oketo iye wir mapol. Bore romo puti pyere abiro wiye abic, ki lace romo puti pyere angwen wiye abic; dok tye ki latin ot ma i dogola me donyo, ma oryeyo iye wir bene, ki bolo matye inyime.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Ka dok ogero ot mukene pi komker kama en bingolo iye kop, en aye kicika me ngolo kop kikome. Kiguro bao cedar ki umu kwede kom kicika ot, cake ki i dye ot piny nio kwede wa i kwori dan ot.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:1">1 Luk 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok ode kikome ma en bedo iye, matye i dyekale mukene ma inge ot ngolo kop, kigero lakite acelu. Solomon dok ogero ot macalo odi mukenenu pi nya pa Parao ma en onyomoni.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Odi magi ducu kigerogi ki godi me wel ma ki payogi muporo kit por ma kimito, kun kibaro ki mucumeno, kipayo ngegi ki igi gubed mapwot, cake ki ikom guti ot nio kwede wa ikom godi ma kiriyo i wiye. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Guti ot obedo godi mabeco me wel, godi madongo mada ma ditogi romo puti apar wiye aryo ki apar wiye abic. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Iwi guti ot bene kiketo iye godi me wel ma kipayogi muporo kit bor ma kimito, kacel ki bao cedar. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Cel me dyekal me gangkal madit bene kiryeyo iye godi apaya latyeng adek ma gurumu dyekal woko, ki bao cedar tyeng acel, calo kit ma kitiyo kwede dyekal Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa Kuram i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Rwot Solomon ocwalo kwena ci kikelo Kuram ki i Turo. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />En onongo wod pa dato mo ma i kaka pa Naputali, wone aye dano me Turo ma ladiro tic me teto jami mola. Kuram dano ma laryeko mada, dok ladiro tic bene, ma ceng obino pi tiyo gin ducu ma dok ikom tic ki mola. En obino bot rwot Solomon, ci Solomon okete me neno dog tic malubu tic ki mola ducu ikare me gedo.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wir mola aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Tek 3:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Kuram oliyo wir mola aryo. Wir acel acel bore romo puti pyere aryo wiye abiro. Kipimo kore ki tol ci dite oromo puti apar wiye aboro, kun iye twolo, kome ducu kinong maromo nyig cing angwen. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />En dok otiyo lalukana wigi ki mola ma kiliyo me aketa iwi wir aryo ducu. Lalukana acel acel bore romo puti abiro ki nucu. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Dok otiyo obwo aryo ma kikedogi ki nyor pi lalukana aryo ducu ma gitye iwi wir; otiyo obwo acel pi lalukana acel, ki acel pi lalukana mukene bene. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />En dok otiyo cal okwer pomegranat bene kitmeno. Ka otiyogi, ci odwalogi ikom nyor latyeng aryo ikom obwo me laum kom lalukana ma kicibo iwi wir; otimo lalukana mukene bene kitmeno. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Lalukana ma gitye iwi wir ma i kicika ot ma i dogolani bocogi romo puti abicel, ma kitiyo calo ature lenga. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Kiketo lalukana aryo ducu iwi wir aryo, iwi doge ma kilulu ma ka nget obwo ma kiumu kwede ni; onongo tye iye cal okwer pomegranat miya aryo, ma kidwalo latyeng aryo; ki lalukana mukene bene tye ki mere marom meno. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Kuram ocibo wir inyim kicika ot ma i dogola me donyo i Ot pa Lubanga. Oketo wir acel tung kupiny, ci ocako nyinge Jakin, ka dok oketo wir mukene tung kumalo, ci ocako nyinge Boaj. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Kiketo cal ature lenga iwi wir aryo ducu. Ci tic ikom wir otum kumeno.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lagwok pii me nyonyo bronze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Tek 4:2-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Kuram dok otiyo lagwok pii ki nyonyo bronze ma kiliyo. Otwode adunu ma lace romo puti apar wiye abic cake idoge tungcel nio idoge tung mukene; bore tung malo romo puti abiro ki nucu. Kipimo doge ki tol ci oromo puti pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Ki idoge ki piny tye iye cal keno munyak ma orumu kom lagwok pii ducu, maromo puti pyere angwen wiye abic; cal keno kiryeyo latyeng aryo. Ikare ma kiliyo lagwok pii, kiliyo ki cal keno ikome lawangacel. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Kicibo lagwok pii ocung iwi cal twoni dyangi apar wiye aryo. Kiketo twoni adek guneno tung kumalo, adek guneno tung kupotoceng, adek guneno tung kupiny, ki adek guneno tung kunyango. Kicibo lagwok pii ocung ikom cal twoninu kun doggi ducu odok tung iye. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Kome kinong maromo incic adek; doge kitiyo macalo dog kikopo, marom ki ature lenga; dok piine romo lita alip pyere angwen.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lutino gadigadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Kuram dok otiyo lutino gadigadi apar me mola. Acel acel bore puti abicel, lace bene puti abicel, ki bore tung malo puti angwen ki nucu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Man aye kit ma kitiyo kwede gadigadi ma tinoni: kipeto mola ma apada i bute ducu, ma okube ki rii. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Ikom mola ma apada ma okube ki riini kigoro iye cal labwor, cal twoni dyangi, ki cal lukerubi. Rii mola bene kideyo doggi ki cal nyor mudwale ka wi labwor ki dyangi, ki katyen gi bene. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Latin gadigadi acel acel obedo ki lawala mola angwen ki bolti me mola. Ka dok i twoke angwen ducu tye iye laten otako. Laten magi kiliyo aliya kun kidwalo cal nyor i butgi. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Doge ongame ki i gin mulunge ma ocung malo, kun bore romo puti acel ki nucu. Dogeni otwode atwoda macalo kitiyo tedi te gin moni, tute romo puti aryo ki incic. Dogeni kideyo kun kigoro iye cal, dok mola apada ma kipeto ikom lutino gadigadini obedo latwoke angwen, pe otwode atwoda. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Lawala angwen tye ite mola apadani; bolti pa lawala gukube ki gadigadi; bor pa lawala romo puti aryo ki incic. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Kitiyo lawalane macalo lawala me gadigadi lweny; boltigi, ki doggi, ki cilikigi, ki abugi kiliyogi aliya. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Kiketo latyele angwen i twoke angwen ma ikom gadigadi acel acel; latyele ducu okube kacel ki gadigadi. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Ki iwi gadigadi kiketo iye gin mulunge ma bore tung malo romo incic abongwen; dok tung wi gadigadi latyele ki mola ma apadane gukube kacel kwede. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Ikom latyele ki ikom mola ma apada kigoro iye cal lukerubi, cal labworgu, ki cal yadi otit, kama romo gorone, ki cal nyor mudwale ingetgi. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Kuram otiyo kit gadigadi macalo meno apar; gin ducu kiliyogi marom, kun ditogi rom, calgi bene tye marom.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Nia 30:17-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka dok otiyo otako mola apar, kun otako acel acel kitwero onyo iye pii maromo lita miya aboro. Otako mola acel acel lace romo puti abicel. Kuram dok otiyo otako mola acel acel me aluta i gadigadi mola apar ducu. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />En oryeyo gadigadi abic inget Ot pa Lubanga tung kupiny, ki abic tung kumalo ka oketo lagwok pii i twok Ot kama bute tung kupiny ki bute tung kunyango gurwate iye.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nying jami ducu ma kitiyo ki Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2 Tek 4:11—5:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Kuram dok otiyo lwak agulu ki akwaya latoke ki becen bene. Kitmeno en otyeko tic ducu ma ikom Ot pa Rwot pi rwot Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Otiyo wir aryo, ki lalukana aryo ma olunge macalo agulu ma kiketo iwi wir, ki obwo aryo me umu kom lalukana aryo ma olunge ma obedo iwi wiri. <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />Dok otiyo cal okwer pomegranat miya angwen pi obwo aryo meno, kun cal okwer pomegranat kiryeyo latyeng aryo ikom obwo acel acel me umu kom lalukana aryo ma olunge ma obedo iwi wiri. <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Dok otiyo lutino gadigadi apar ki otako mola apar ma kilutu i gadigadi; <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />ki lagwok pii acel, ki cal twoni dyangi apar wiye aryo ma kiketo lagwok pii ocung ikomgi.<verse eid="1KI 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Lwak agulu ducu, ki akwaya latokegu, ki becengu, jami magi ducu ma i Ot pa Rwot, ma Kuram otiyogi pi rwot Solomon, obedo me mola ma kijwayo maleng. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Rwot Solomon omiyo kiliyo mola meno i pwor kulu Jordan, kama lobo agulu tye iye, ikin Cukot ki Jaretan. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomon oweko jamini ducu kitiyo ma pe kipimo pekgi, pien onongo jami dwong tutwal, omiyo pek me nyonyo ma kitiyo kwede pe kingeyo.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Nia 25:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">30:1-3</ref></char>
    </note>Kitmeno bene Solomon omiyo kitiyo jami ducu ma mite i Ot pa Rwot, gin aye ene: keno tyer me jabu, meja me jabu pi mugati me aketa inyim Rwot, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Nia 25:31-40</ref></char></note>okar mac me jabu ma kiliyo maber ma kiryeyogi inyim Kabedo Maleng Makato ma i tyelo abic, tung kupiny ki abic tung kumalo; ki lwak cal ature ki laputgu, ki boyi lakar mac, ducu me jabu; <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />ki kikopogu, magacgu, becengu, atabo me odok eceta ki wee me wango mac, ducu me jabu ma kiliyo maber; ki pata jabu ma kiketo ikom kika me donyo i kicika ma i tyelo, en aye Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu, ki ikom kika me kicika madite ma i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:11">2 Cam 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:11">1 Tek 18:11</ref></char>
    </note>Tic ducu ma rwot Solomon otiyo ikom Ot pa Rwot otum kitmeno, Solomon dok okelo iye jami ducu mayam wone Daudi odyerogi bot Rwot; ci okelo ryal ki jabu ki jami mukenegu ducu, ma ceng okanogi i ot kano lim ma i Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon okelo Canduk me Gicike i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Tek 5:2—6:2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:12-16">2 Cam 6:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-29">1 Tek 15:25-29</ref></char>
    </note>Solomon ocoko ludongo pa jo Icrael ki ludito wi kakagi ducu, ma gin aye rwodi kaka ma i dogola pa kwarigi ducu ma gitye ikin jo Icrael. Ci gubino inyim rwot Solomon i Jerucalem pi kwanyo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot ki i gangkal pa Daudi ma kilwongo ni Cion, wek kikel i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lev 23:24</ref></char></note>Lwak jo Icrael ducu gucoke bot rwot Solomon ikare me kwero nino madito me dwe Etanim, ma en aye dwe me abiro. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Ci ludongo ducu pa jo Icrael gubino, ka ajwaki pa Lubanga gucako tingo Canduk. <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Gutero Canduk i Ot pa Rwot, ki kema me rwate, kacel ki jami maleng ducu mayam tye i kema kunu ajwaki ki Lulevi aye gumakogi. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Ci Solomon laloc me Icrael ki lwak ducu ma gucoke boteni gubino inyim Canduk pa Rwot, kun gitumu lwak romi ki twonigu mapol ma welgi pe kwane. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Kitmeno ajwaki pa Lubanga gukelo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot wa i kabedone kikome, i Kabedo Maleng Makato. Ci guketo piny ite bwom Lukerubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Pien lukerubi guyaro bwomgi ka wi kabedo me Canduk wek guum wi Canduk woko, kacel ki tal latinge ducu. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Tal latinge onongo giboco, omiyo wigi nen ki i Kabedo Maleng Makato ma i tyeloni, ento onongo pe kitwero nenogi ki woko; dok pud gitye kunu wa onyo. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:5">Nwo 10:5</ref></char></note>Gin mo onongo pe i Canduk, kono kidi aryo ma apada keken mayam Moses oketo iye i Koreb, kama yam Rwot oketo iye gicikene ki jo Icrael, ikare ma gia ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="1KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Nia 40:34-35</ref></char></note>Ka ajwaki gukato woko ki i Kabedo Maleng Makato, ci pol obino opongo i Ot pa Rwot woko; <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />pi eno omiyo ajwaki pe gutwero cung katiyo ticgi, pi pol meno ma onongo tye i Ot; pien deyo pa Rwot nongo opongo i Ot pa Rwot woko limuk. <verse eid="1KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:11">Jab 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:2">97:2</ref></char></note>Ci Solomon olego kun owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 8:12">“Rwot yam oketo ceng i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 8:12">ento en owaco ni ebedo i pol macol licuc.<verse eid="1KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Ageri dong ot ma ocudu malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 8:13">wek obed kabedoni ma ibedo iye matwal.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Solomon bot lwak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2 Tek 6:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Ka dok rwot Solomon oloke bot lwak ma gucoke kun gucung mot, ci olego gum pa Rwot ikomgi. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />En owaco ni, “Kipak Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, ma dong cinge otyeko cobo gin mayam oloko ki doge bot wora Daudi, kun owaco ni, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:4-11">2 Cam 7:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:3-10">1 Tek 17:3-10</ref></char></note>‘Nia wa ikare ma akwanyo jona jo Icrael ki i Ejipt, peya ayero taun madit mo ma i kaka ma i Icrael ducu pi gero iye ot mo, wek nyinga obed iye; ento ayero mera Daudi wek oloo lwaka jo Icrael.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-3">2 Cam 7:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-2">1 Tek 17:1-2</ref></char></note>I karenu onongo wora Daudi obedo ki tam i cwinye me gero ot pi woro nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Ento Rwot aye owaco bot wora Daudi ni, ‘Kit macalo onongo dong tam tye i cwinyi me gero ot pi nyinga, itimo ber pi keto lok meno i cwinyi. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Cam 7:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1 Tek 17:11-12</ref></char></note>Ento pe in aye ibigera ot; wodi ma ibinywalo aye bigero ot pi woro nyinga.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />Ci Rwot dong otyeko cobo gin ma en ociko; pien an dong atyeko leyo katyen wora Daudi, an dong abedo iwi komker pa Icrael, kit mayam Rwot ocikoni, dok atyeko gero Ot pi woro nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Dong atyeko keto iye kabedo pa Canduk pa Rwot matye iye Gicike ma Rwot con oketo ki kwariwa, ikare ma okwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2 Tek 6:12-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Solomon dok ocung inyim keno tyer pa Rwot ki inyim lwak jo Icrael ma gucoke ducu, ci otango cinge malo okemo polo. <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />Ci olego lega kuman ni, “Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, pe tye Lubanga mo macalo in i loboni, kadi malo i polo nyo piny wa ite lobo, matye kagwoko gicikene macalo in, ma inyutu mar meri ma pe loke bot lutici ma gibedo kalubi ki cwinygi ducu. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Ibedo kalubu gin mayam itito bot wora Daudi; eyo gin mayam i loko ki dogi, i cako dong tiyone ikare man ki cingi, ci icobo ducu maber. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Luk 2:4</ref></char></note>Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, dong ilub gin mayam iciko bot latici Daudi ma wora, kun iwaco ni, ‘Pe ibibedo labongo danoni mo ma bibedo iwi komker me Icrael, teke awobeni gugwoko kitgi maber, kun gibedo ki kit kwo maber inyima kit ma in ibedo kwede i nyimani.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Ai Lubanga pa Icrael, kombedi mi loki dong omok matek, kit mayam i loko bot wora Daudi ma latici. Ai Rwot, wek obed kumeno.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 2:6">2 Tek 2:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento in Lubanga mono i twero bedo iwi lobo ni ada? Nen, kadi polo bene kulu mamalo tutwali pe romo in me bedo iye, ci ot ma ageroni tidine rom mene kono! <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Kadi bed kitmeno, an alegi iwiny legana, ma an latici, ki kit ma abako kwede doga, ai Rwot Lubangana; winy koko ki lega ma atye kalego inyimi tin. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Nwo 12:11</ref></char></note> Wangi aye iwek obed twolo dyewor ki dyeceng benebene me neno tung botwa i Ot man, en aye kabedo mayam iwaco pire ni, ‘Ci an abibedo kunu,’ wek ibed kawinyo legana ma akelo boti kun waloke wakemo kabedo man. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Dok iwiny legana ki lega pa joni jo Icrael ikare ma wabako dogwa, ma walego wakemo kabedo man atir. Eyo in dong ibed kawinyo bako dogwa ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni; ci ka dong ityeko winyone, dong iwek balwa, kit ma alegini.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />Kace dano mo otimo bal ikom ngat mo, ci kimiye okwong kwong pire, ka obino ce okwongo kwonge ki inyim keno tyeri ma i Ot man, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />ci in Lubanga iwiny ki i polo, ci itii gin ma mite. Ngol kop pa laticini, imii kop oloo dano ma otingo alii, kun iket gin ma en otimo i wiye kene, dok i mii dano ma pe obalo oloo kop kun itime ber ma oporo leng cwinye.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />Kace mony pa lumerok guloyo joni jo Icrael pi balgi ma gutimo ikomi, kace gungut, gudwogo boti, ci gucako tucu nyingi, ma gilego in ka gibako doggi boti i Ot man, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ci in iwinygi ki i polo, iwek bal pa joni jo Icrael, ka dok idwokgi cen wa i lobo mayam imiyo bot kwarigi.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />Kace polo ocege woko, ma kot mo pe cwer pi lakit balgi mo ikomi, kace lwaki gucako lega kun gikemo in i kabedo man, kun gitucu nyingi, kun gungut ci gubwoto balgi woko ikare ma iketo can ikomgini, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />ci in Lubanga iwinygi ki i polo, iwek balgi, gin joni jo Icrael, dok ipwonygi ki kit yo maber ma myero gulubi; ci dong imii kot ocwer i loboni mayam imiyo bot lwaki ni obed meggi.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />Kace kec opoto i lobo, onyo kono two gemo aye opoto, nyo kace bel obware nyo odoko ocone, nyo ka bonyo aye opoto nyo okwil obino, nyo kace merok pa joni orumugi woko ki i ganggi mo, nyo kadi bed kit gemo ango, nyo kit two moni, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />kace lwaki gucako lego nyo bako doggi boti, kadi bed dano acel kok boti, nyo joni jo Icrael ducu, kun dano acel acel ngeyo kit atwom ma i cwinye, kace otango cinge kun en okemo Ot man; <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />ci in Lubanga iwinygi ki i polo kama ibedo iye, iwek balgi, ci itii gin ma mite. Tim dano acel acel kit ma ingeyo kwede cwinye, ma rwate ki kit kwone ducu, pien in aye, in keni ingeyo kit cwiny pa dano ducu. <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />Meno bimiyo gibedo kalwori nino ducu ma gibedo iye i lobo mayam imiyo bot kwariwa.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />Obed kitmeno bene kace larok mo, ma pe joni jo Icrael, obino kany ma oa ki i lobo mo mabor, kun obino pi yweka me nyingi; <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />pien gibiwinyo pi nyingi ma diti, ki pi twero me badi ki kit ma iryeyo ki cingi pi konyo joni, onyo kace larok mo obino ce ocako lega ma okemo Ot man, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />ci in Lubanga iwiny ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni, i tim kit gin ducu ma laroki okok kwede inyimi, wek rok ma wi lobo ducu gunge nyingi, gulwori, kit ma lwaki jo Icrael gilworini, dok wek gunge maber ni, Ot man ma ageroni kilwongo ki nyingi me wori keken.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />Kace lwaki gucito kalweny ki lumerokgi i kabedo mo ducu ma icwalogi iye, kace gukelo legagi boti in Rwot ma gukemo gang man ma in iyero, ki Ot man ma agero pi woro nyingi ni, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />ci in iwiny legagi ki bako doggi ki i polo, imii giloc ka ineno ni lokgi tye atir.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />Kace gutimo bal ikomi, pien pe tye dano mo ma pe balo, kace kiniga omaki ikomgi, ci imiyogi i cing lamerok mo ma oyakogi ci oterogi i opii wa i lobo pa lumerokgi, kamabor nyo kamacok, ci iwiny legagi. <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />Kace cwinygi otamo lok ki i lobo ma kiterogi iye i opiini, ce gungut ci gubako doggi boti ki i lobo ma gitye iye i cing luyakgi, kun gikok ni, ‘Wabalo, wangak woko ata, watiyo lwak balgu mapol,’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />kace gungut ki tamgi ducu ki cwinygi ducu i lobo pa lumerokgi mayam oterogi i opii ni, kun dong gilego inyimi ma gukemo lobogi mayam imiyo bot kwarigi, ki gang ma nene iyero, ki Ot man ma agero pi woro nyingi ni; <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />ci in Lubanga iwiny legagi ki bako doggi ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni, ci iye imii botgi gin ma gilego. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Dok iwek bal pa joni ma gubalo ikomi pi tim aranyigi ducu ma gibalo kwede inyimi, imii kica omak jo mayam guterogi i opiini, wek kica ocak makogi ikomgi bene. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />Pien gin aye lwaki kikome, gin joni kikome mayam i kwanyogi ki i Ejipt, ma obedo calo ruk mac me teto nyonyo ma otwak me wangogi. <verse eid="1KI 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />Wek wangi onen kit bako dog pa latici, ki bako dog pa lwaki jo Icrael, cik iti ikomgi ikare ducu ma gikok boti. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Pien yam dong ikoyogi woko pat ki ikin rok ma wi lobo ducu wek gubed joni kikome, kit mayam i tucu loke ki i dog latici Moses ikare mayam ikwanyo kwariwa woko ki i Ejipt, ai Rwot Lubanga.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Ka dong Solomon otyeko lego lega meno ducu kacel ki bako dogegu inyim Rwot, ci oa malo ki inyim keno tyer pa Rwot kama onongo en orumu iye conge, kun otango cinge malo okemo polo. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Ka dong ocung, ci olamo gum ikom jo Icrael ma gucoke ducu kun dange ki dwone malongo ma waco ni, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:10">Nwo 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:44-45">Yoc 21:44-45</ref></char></note>“Kipak Rwot ma dong omiyo jone jo Icrael guywe, kit mayam ociko ducu! Ikom lok ducu mabeco mayam ociko ki i dog latice Moses, pe tye lok mo acel ma pe ocobo kakare. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Rwot Lubangawa obed kwedwa kit mayam obedo ki kwariwani; pe obwotwa, pe otenywa ata, <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />wek olok cwinywa odok ikome. Kitmeno wabilubu yone ducu, kun wagwoko lok ma en ociko, ki cike ducu mayam ociko ki kwariwa. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Wek lok ma dong aloko ducu, ma abako ki doga inyim in Rwoti, obed cok inyim Rwot Lubangawa dyeceng ki dyewor, wek en otim pira ma an latice ni, ki pi lwake jo Icrael, gin matye atir inino acel acel. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Meno bimiyo rok ma wi lobo ducu ngeyo ni, Rwot aye Lubanga kene; mukene peke. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Wun wubed ki lengic ikom Rwot Lubangawa, wulub cik ma en oketo, kun wugwoko lok ma en ociko ducu macalo wutiyo tini.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Tek 7:4-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Ka dok rwot ki jo Icrael ducu gucako tyero gitum inyim Rwot. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Solomon otyero gityer lakwe cwiny bot Rwot maromo twoni dyangi alip pyere aryo wiye aryo, ki romi alip miya acel ki pyere aryo. Rwot Solomon kacel ki jo Icrael ducu gukwero Ot pa Rwot Lubanga kitmeno. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Inino meno bene Solomon okwero kabedo ma i cwiny dyekal matye inyim Ot pa Rwot. Otyero kunu gitum awanga ki gityer me moko kwon ki moo dwolo me gityer lakwe cwiny, pien keno tyer mola ma inyim Rwot onongo tidi tutwal, ma pe romo keto iye gitum awanga kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki dwolo me gityer lakwe cwinygu.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Kitmeno Solomon okwero nino madito ikare meno, kacel ki jo Icrael ducu. Onongo lwak gucoke mapol kun gua wa i yoo ma donyo i Kamat nio wa i laora kulu me Ejipt, ci gubedo inyim Rwot Lubangawa pi nino abiro. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Ikom nino me aborone Solomon ocwalo lwak gudok woko tugi. Lwak gupwoyo rwot Solomon, ci gudok i pacogi ki yomcwiny madwong, ma igi okwe pi gin ducu mabeco ma Rwot Lubanga otimo pi latice Daudi ki pi lwake jo Icrael.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot onen bot Solomon tyen me aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Tek 7:11-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Ikare ma rwot Solomon dong otyeko gero Ot pa Rwot, ki ode, ki odi mukene ducu ma onongo en mito gerogi, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:5">1 Luk 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:7">2 Tek 1:7</ref></char></note>ci Rwot dok onyute bote i lek tyen me aryone, kit mayam onen bote i Gibeon ca. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Rwot owace ni, “Atyeko winyo legani, ki bako dogi ma iketo inyima dok atyeko lonyo Ot man ma i geroni wek obed maleng. Dong aketo nyinga iye wek obed iye matwal; ki dok wanga ki cwinya bikemo kunu nino ducu. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Dong ki tung boti, kace i bibedo ki kit kwo maber inyima macalo yam woru Daudi obedo kwede ni, kun ii leng dok cwinyi atir, ce dok ibitiyo gin ma aciko ducu kun i gwoko cik ma aketo, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Luk 2:4</ref></char></note>ci an Lubangani abimoko komkeri me loyo jo Icrael matwal, kit mayam aciko bot woru Daudini kun awaco bote ni, ‘Pe ibibedo labongo danoni mo ma bibedo iwi komker me Icrael.’ <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Ento kace in nyo likwayi wungak wuweko lubu kora, ma wukwero mako lok ma aciko ki cik ma aketo inyimwu, ce wukobo woko katiyo bot lubanga mogogu mukene kun wuworogi, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />ci miyo abityeko jo Icrael woko ki i lobo mayam amiyo botgini; dok abiloko wanga woko cen, pe dong abineno Ot man, ma dong alonyo obedo maleng pi nyinga ma kiworo iyeni; miyo nying jo Icrael bidoko carolok ki lok aboka ikin rok ducu. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">2 Luk 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:19">2 Tek 36:19</ref></char></note>Ot man bidoko obur ma odure lipim; miyo dano ducu ma gibikato kangete gibiuru ki jwat kun giwaco ni. ‘Kit lok ango ma omiyo Rwot otimo loboni ki Ot man ki tim macalo man?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Ka dok gibiwaco ni, ‘Pien gubwoto Rwot Lubangagi mayam okwanyo kwarigi ki i lobo Ejipt, ci gukobo ite loc pa lubanga mogogu mukene, dok gubedo kaworogi ma kun gitiyo botgi bene; en aye lok ma omiyo Rwot omiyo can man opoto ikomgi magwar.’”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic mukene ma Solomon otiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:1-18">2 Tek 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Gero odi aryoni otero Solomon mwaka pyere aryo kulu me gerone, gin aye Ot pa Rwot ki ot me bedo pa rwot. <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Ikare meno rwot Kiram me Turo omiyo bot Solomon bao cedar ki bao ciprec, ki jabu bene kit ma en mito ducu. Lacen ka man dong otum, Solomon omiyo bot Kiram taun pyere aryo ma i lobo Galilaya. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Ento ka Kiram oa ki i Turo ocito kaneno taun magi ma Solomon omiyo bote ni, ci oneno taun magi pe guyomo cwinye. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Kiram owaco bot Solomon ni, “Omera, man kono kit taun ango ma imiya ni?” Kitmeno omiyo lobone kilwongo ni Kabul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="fk">Kabul </char> tyen loke ni ngom ma konye peke.</note> nio wa onyo. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Kiram onongo yam ocwalo bot Solomon jabu maromo talanta miya acel ki pyere aryo.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Man aye lok ikom tic muroni ma rwot Solomon omiyo kirono pi gero Ot pa Rwot, ode kikome, Millo, ki cel ma orumu Jerucalem, kacel ki taun madito magi; Kajor, Megiddo ki Gejer. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Onongo Parao rwot me Ejipt yam ocito omako Gejer ka owango woko ki mac, ka dok oneko Lukaanan ma gibedo i taun madito meno ci omiyo bot nyare ma Solomon onyomo, wek obed mot me nyomgi. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Ci Solomon ogero Gejer odoco, ka orono bene dano pi gero Bet-koron Mapiny, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />kacel ki Baalat, Tamar matye i tim me lobo Juda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />ki taun madito ducu me kano cam mayam Solomon tye kwede, ki taun madito me gadigadine me mony, taun madito pa lulweny ma giringo ki aguragurane, ki kit gedo ducu ma Solomon omito gerogi i Jerucalem ki i Lebanon ki i lobo ma en loyo ducu.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Likwayo pa jo ma pe gin jo Icrael mayam gubwot ci gudong i lobo ki ikom jo Amor, jo Kit, jo Perej, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />ma jwerogi woko liweng yam oloyo jo Icrael, gin aye Solomon oketo tic muroni iwigi macalo gin opii, kit macalo tyeni nio wa onyo. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Ento Solomon pe omiyo jo Icrael gutiyo tic macalo opii: gin gubedo acikarine, ki ludito tice, ludito wi mony, lukapten, ludito maloyo gadigadi lweny, ki lulweny ma ringo ki aguragura.<verse eid="1KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Ludito pa Solomon ma giloyo dog tic ducu onongo giromo miya abic ki pyere abic; gin aye guloyo lwak ducu ma gitiyo tic ducu.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Nya pa Parao odak woko ki i gangkal pa Daudi, okobo i ode kikome ma Solomon ogero pire; ka dok lacen Solomon ogero Millo.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:17">Nia 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:23">34:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Nwo 16:16</ref></char>
    </note>Solomon obedo katyero gitum awanga ki gityer lakwe cwiny tyen adek i mwaka acel acel, kun tyerogi iwi keno tyer ma kitiyo pi Rwot, ka dok owango odok eceta inyim Rwot. Ci Solomon otyeko tic me gero Ot pa Rwot kitmeno.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Rwot Solomon omiyo kipayo lwak meli i Ejion-geber, matye cok ki Elot i dog Nam Makwar i lobo Edom. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Ci Kiram ocwalo lutice ma gin lunam ma gungiyo tic ki nam wek guwot ki mel meno kacel ki jo pa Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Gucito i Opir kaomo jabu ki kunu; gukelo maromo talanta miya angwen ki pyere aryo ci gudwogo kwede gumiyo bot rwot Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ma dako me Ceba olimo Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Tek 9:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12:42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luk 11:31</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare meno rwot ma dako me Ceba owinyo pi yweka pa Solomon laloc madit me lobo Icrael, ci obino bote katemo wiye ki peny mogo matego. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />En obino i Jerucalem ki lwak jone madito ma gucom i kore, kacel ki kinagagu ma guyeyo angwece, ki jabu madwong tutwal, ki lutino godi me wel. Ka obino bot Solomon, ci openye ki kit peny ducu ma onongo tye i cwinye. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Solomon odok i lapenye ducu; pe onongo tye lok mo wa ki acel ma okane ki bot rwot ma tucune oloye. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Ka rwot ma dako me Ceba man oneno kit ryeko pa Solomon ducu, ki kit ot ma en ogero, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />oneno lwak cam ma iwi mejane, kabedo pa luditone, ki tic pa lutice ducu, ki bongigi, ki lutino kikopogu ma kipoko ki kong bwino i ot came, ki gitum awanga ma en tyero i Ot pa Rwot, ci tam otum woko ki i cwinye.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Ci owaco bot rwot Solomon ni, “Lok ducu ma ikomi mayam kitero bota i lobona, ki lok ikom ryekoni, anongo ni loke tye kakare. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Ento yam pe aye lok ducu ma kitero bota, nio ka abino aneno in ki wanga. Nen, pe kitita kadi wa nucune kulu, pien ryekoni ki lonyo meri kato lok dog ma kitero bota. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Monni gitye ki yomcwiny kuman! Lutici ducu gitye ki yomcwiny marom mene, ma gin bedo kacung inyimi jwijwi kawinyo lok me ryekoni! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Kipak Rwot Lubangani ma cwinye opwoyo in, ci oketi iwi komker me Icrael! Pien Rwot omaro Icrael matwal, en aye ma omiyo oketi ibedo rwot, wek ibed kangolo kop atir dok kakare.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Ka inge lok man en omiyo bot Solomon jabu madwong maromo talanta miya acel ki pyere aryo, ki lwak angwece mapatpat madwong tutwal, ki lwak lutino godi me wel. Angwece pe dok kimiyo madwong bot rwot Solomon marom ki ma rwot ma dako me Ceba omiyo bote.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Dok bene mel ma Kiram ceng kelo ki jabu ma i Opir okelo bene ki bao me yat almug madwong tutwal, ki lwak godi matino me wel. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Solomon omiyo kitiyo ki bao almug pi jengo ki kor Ot pa Rwot ki kor ot pa rwot me bedone, ka dong mukeneni en omiyo kiyubu ki jami woro ki gin me wer me pako Rwot. Kitiyo ki opuk ki nanga pa luwer. Kit bao me almug macalo meno pe dok kikelo i lobo, pe dok bene onen, nio wa onyo.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Ka lacen rwot Solomon omiyo bot rwot ma dako me lobo Ceba jami ducu ma cwinye oparo dok nyo ogomo ci omine. Gin ma en openyo pire, med ki gin ma en Solomon oyubu pi miyo bote muporo lonyone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 10:13">Kitmeno rwot ma dako me Ceba ocako wote me dok i lobone kacel ki lutice ducu.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo pa Solomon ki ywekane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2 Tek 9:13-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Lwak jabu ma bino bot Solomon i mwaka acel acel peke onongo cok romo kilo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />ma pe kiribo iye ma obino ki tung bot lucat wil ma paco ki me lobo ma woko, ki ma oa ki bot luker me lobo Arabia ki bot lulo dul lobo mapatpat me lobo Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Rwot Solomon otiyo lwak kwot madongo miya aryo me jabu, ma kitetogi ki nyol; ikom kwot acel acel kimwono iye jabu ma peke cok romo kilo abicel. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Dok otiyo lwak kwot ma tinone miya adek ma kitetogi ki nyol, kun kwot acel acel kiteto ki jabu ma peke cok romo kilo aryo. Solomon omiyo kiketogi i ot ma kilwongo ni Bunga me Lebanon.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />En dok otiyo komker madit me lak lyec, ci omwono kome woko ki jabu ma kiliyo maber. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Komker meno onongo tye ki rwome abicel, ki inge komker, kiketo iye cal wi labwor. Kangete tungi ki tungi kiketo iye ka teno cing dano, ki cal labwor aryo gucung kanget bad kom me teno cing tungi ki tungi. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Onongo tye bene cal labwor apar wiye aryo ma gucung i agiki rwom abiceli, tungi ki tungi. Pe tye kit komker mo mayam kitiyo ma cal ki meno ite ker ducu ma iwi lobo.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Jami ducu mayam rwot Solomon mato kwede onongo tye me jabu keken, wa jami ducu ma kitiyo kwedgi i ot Bunga me Lebanon obedo me jabu ma kiliyo maber. Pe tye iye jami me ryal mo wa ki acel, pien ikare ca pa Solomon, pe tye ngati mo ma onongo tamo pi ryal ni obedo gin mo. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Onongo en tye ki lwak mel ma dongone ma giwoto i nam kacel ki mel pa Kiram. Mel man madongoni ma kilwongo ni mel me Tarcic yam dwogo cen ka mwaka okato adekadek kun gikelo jabu ki ryal ki lak lyecgu, kacel ki ayomgu ki gunyagu.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Rwot Solomon obedo ki dit makato luker ma iwi lobo ducu pi lonyone ki pi ryekone. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Dano me rok ducu gubedo kayenyo kit yo me neno wang Solomon, ki pi bino bote wek giwiny kit lok me ryekone ma Lubanga oketo i cwinyeni. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Dano acel acel otero mote bote, kun kitero jami me ryal ki me jabugu, me ginarukagu, me odok mura, angwece, aguragura ki kanagu mwaka ki mwaka.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:26">1 Luk 4:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Solomon ocoko gadigadi lweny ki lulweny ma giringo ki aguragura. Ci en obedo ki gadigadi lweny alip acel ki miya angwen, ki wegi aguragura alip apar wiye aryo. En oketo mogo ki ikin gi i taun madito me gadigadi lweny, ki mukene gubedo bote i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Rwot Solomon omiyo ryal odoko gin malam marom ki gweng gu i Jerucalem, dok yam okelo yadi cedar mapol ata marom ki olam ma i bar Cepela. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Nwo 17:16</ref></char></note>En yam wilo aguragura ma a ki i Ejipt ki Kuc; ma lucat wile gamogi ki i Kuc i wel lim ma onongo kiyubu. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Gadigadi lweny ma gia ki i Ejipt welgi onongo romo cekel me ryal miya abicel, ki aguragura acel wele cekel miya acel ki pyere abic; ka dok lucat wil pa rwot catogi bot luker ducu pa jo Kit ki bot luker me Ciria.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa Solomon me bwoto woro Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:17">Nwo 17:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot Solomon obedo kamaro mon mapol ma anyira rok mapatpat. Onyomo nya pa Parao, anyira Moab, anyira Ammon, anyira me Edom, anyira me Cidon ki anyira pa jo Kit. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Nia 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3-4">Nwo 7:3-4</ref></char></note>Onyomogi ki i rok mayam Rwot ojuku jo Icrael ikomgi kun waco ni, “Pe wubinyomo anyiragi, kadi wa gin bene pe gibinyomo anyirawu, pien ada miyo giloko cwinywu dok cen kalubu lubangagi.” Ento Solomon cwinye omaro anyiranu matek. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />En obedo ki mon miya abiro ma gin ducu anyira pa luker, ki mon mukene ma angeca miya adek; ci mone guloko cwinye woko ada. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Ka Solomon dong otii woko, ci mone guloko cwinye odok ikom lubanga mogo mukene, omiyo pe obedo kalubu lok pa Rwot Lubangane, kit mayam wone Daudi obedo kwede. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Solomon ocako lubu kit pa jok ma dako pa jo Cidon ma nyinge Acitoret, ki jok kipyeda pa jo Ammon ma kilwongo Milkom. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Kitmeno Solomon otiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, pe dong otiyo gin ma Rwot mito ki cwinye ducu, kit mayam wone Daudi otiyoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Solomon dok ogero wang jok me woro Kemoc ma jok kipyeda pa jo Moab, ki me woro Molek ma jok kipyeda pa jo Ammon; oketo wang jogigi iwi got ma inget Jerucalem tung kunyango. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Obedo katimo kitmeno pi mone ducu me rok mukene ma giwango odok eceta dok gityero gitum bot lubangagi.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Rwot okeco ikom Solomon, pien onongo cwinye dong oweko Rwot Lubangane woko, mayam onen bote tyen aryoni, <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />mayam bene ociko Solomon ikom lok man kun waco bote ni pe olub kor lubanga mukene; ento en pe omako cik ma Rwot omiyeni. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Omiyo Rwot owaco bot Solomon ni, “Kit macalo cwinyi tye kit man, ma ikwero mako gicikena ki cik ma aketo ma aciki kwede, an dong abimayo keri woko, amiyo bot latici. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Ento pi woru Daudi miyo pe abitimo i kareni, ento abimayo woko ki i cing wodi. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Kadi bed kumeno, pe abikwanyo keri woko ducu, ento abimiyo kaka acel bot wodi, pi nying latica Daudi, ki pi Jerucalem mayam ayero.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lumerok pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Rwot okelo merok ikom Solomon, Adad ma jo Edom ma obedo wat pa Luker me Edom. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Onongo yam ikare ma Daudi obedo i Edom, Joab ma ladit me mony ocito kunu pi yiko kom dano ma kineko, ci oneko co ma onongo kunu woko ducu ma gitye i Edom. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Ikare meno Joab ki jo Icrael gubedo kunu dwe abicel kulu, nio ka gutyeko co ma i Edom woko liweng. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Ento kono do latin me ot ker pa jo Edom Adad aye kiringo kwede woko ki jo Edom mogo ma gin lutic pa wone wa i Ejipt. Ikare meno onongo Adad pud tidi. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Gua woko ki i Midian gucito i Paran, ci gukwanyo co mogo ki i Paran gucito kwedgi i Ejipt bot Parao rwot me Ejipt. Parao omiyo ot bot Adad ki cam, wa ki but lobo bene. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Adad olimo gum madwong ki bot Parao, Parao dok omiye onyomo ywere ma lamin dakone kikome ma dakeri, ma nyinge Tapanec. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Lamin Tapanec onywalo latin laco ki Adad, nyinge Genubat, ci Tapanec omiyo Genubat odongo i ot pa Parao kun bedo kacel ki awobe pa Parao. <verse eid="1KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Ento ka Adad owinyo ki i Ejipt ni Daudi dong oto, ma kiyike kacel ki kwarine, ki Joab ma ladit me mony bene otyeko to woko, ci Adad openyo Parao ni, “Wek dong aa woko ki boti, adok dong i lobowa.” <verse eid="1KI 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Parao openye ni, “Gin ango ma pe i nongo kany ma omiyo imito dok woko i lobo tuwuni?” Adad ogamo ni, “Kong dong iwek acit mono.”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Lubanga dok okelo merok mukene bot Solomon. Okelo Rejor ma wod pa Eliada, ma onongo yam oringo woko ki bot rwode Adadejer rwot ma i Joba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />En ocoko lwak dano mapol ma gubedo bote, ci odoko ladit me buca mony pa luyak ki inge nek ma Daudi onekogi kwede. Gucito i Damaciko, gubedo kunu, ci guketo en obedo rwot i Damaciko kun loyo lobo Ciria. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />En obedo lamerok pa jo Icrael ikare pa Solomon ducu, obedo katimo tim aranyi kit mayam Adad timoni. En obedo lumone pa jo Icarel, kun cwinye dag jo Icrael adada.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Lubanga oloko bot Jeroboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Dano mukene ma oilo cinge ikom rwot Solomon obedo Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma jo Epraim me Jereda. En yam obedo latic pa Solomon; mine nyinge Jerua ma nene cware oto. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Jeroboam oryeyo cinge ikom rwot pi tyen lok man. Ikare ca onongo Solomon obedo ka gero Millo dok onongo mito ni, i ci ceg wang cel me gangkal pa wone Daudi kama yam kimuku wokoni ducu. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Jeroboam onongo tye ki kero me kom ki bene obedo kwiri i dog tice. Ka Solomon oneno ni en latin awobi ma kome mit i tic, ci omiye dit me loyo tic muroni ducu pa jo me ot pa Yucepu. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Ikare mo ma Jeroboam oweko Jerucalem okato woko, ci nen lanebi Akija ma Lacilo orwate kwede i yo, kun onongo Akija oruku bongo manyen. Gin aryonu onongo gitye mere ken gi i dye tim. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Ci Akija olunyu bongo manyen ma Jeroboam oruku ikomeni, oyeco iye dul apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Ka ocako lok ki Jeroboam kun waco ni, “Gam dul bongo apari i ter obed meri, pien Rwot Lubanga me Icrael owaco kuman ni. ‘Nen, an acok mayo ker woko ki i cing Solomon, ci abimiyo kaka apar i cingi. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Ento en bidong ki kaka acel pi nying latica Daudi, ki pi Jerucalem mayam ayero ni, en aye gang mayam ayero ki ikin kaka ma i Icrael ducu me bedo mega. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Pien Solomon dong otyeko bwota woko, ci ocako woro gire Acitoret ma jok ma dako ma jo Cidon giworo ni, ki Kemoc ma jok pa jo Moab, ki Milkom ma jok pa jo Ammon. En pe dong tye kalubu kora, pe dok tiyo gin manen atir i wanga, pe dok mako cik ma aketo, pe dong lubu cika kit mayam wone Daudi olubuni. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Ento pe abikwanyo ker woko ducu ki i cinge kikome; abimiyo en bedo laloc ikare me kwone ducu, pi latica Daudi mayam ayero, mayam ogwoko cika ki cik ma aketo ducu. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Ento abikwanyo ker woko ki i cing wode, abimiyo boti, gin kaka apari ducu. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Ci abimiyo kaka mo acel bot wode, wek latica Daudi obed ki mac tara inyima jwijwi i Jerucalem, i gang mayam ayero me keto iye nyinga wek kiwora. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Abiketo in Jeroboam ibedo rwot me Icrael, ci ibiloyo lobo ma cwinyi mito ducu. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Kace ibiwinyo cika ma aciki kwede, ce i lubu yona, kun itiyo gin manen atir i wanga, pi gwoko cika ki gin ma aciko ducu kit mayam latica Daudi ogwokoni, ci abibedo kwedi; an aye abimiyo odi cung matek atika, kit mayam atimo pi Daudini, dok abimiyo jo Icrael i cingi. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Abiketo can ikom likwayo pa Daudi, ento cane pe bibedo matwal.’” <verse eid="1KI 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Ci Solomon otemo neko Jeroboam ento Jeroboam oa woko, oringo i Ejipt bot Cicak rwot me Ejipt, ci obedo gire i Ejipt nio ka Solomon oto.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Tek 9:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Lok kom Solomon mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam otiyo, ki ryekone, kityeko coyone ducu i buk ma tito kwo pa Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Kare ma Solomon oloyo kwede jo Icrael ducu kun bedo i Jerucalem oromo mwaka pyere angwen. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Solomon oto ci oywe kacel ki kwarine, ka kiyiko i gangkal pa wone Daudi. Rekoboam ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael ma Kumalo gujemo ikom Rekoboam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Tek 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Rekoboam ocito i Cekem, pien onongo jo Icrael ducu gumol gucito i Cekem kaketo en me bedo rwot. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Ka Jeroboam wod pa Nebat owinyo pire, ci oa ki i Ejipt odok cen; pien onongo Jeroboam pud tye i Ejipt kama yam oringo iye rwot Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Kicwalo lukwena kalwonge, ci Jeroboam ki lwak jo Icrael ma Kumalo ducu ma gucoke guwaco bot Rekoboam ni, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Woru oketo yec mapek ikomwa. In dong i lok tic matego ma woru omiyowa, ki yec mapeki ma en oketo ikomwani obed mayot, ci wan ducu wabibedo lutici.” <verse eid="1KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Rekoboam ogamo doggi ni, “Kong wudok cen wubed kunu nino adek, ka dok wudwog bota kany.” Ci lwak gudok cen.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Rwot Rekoboam ocako poro lok ki ludongo muteggi, mayam gicung inyim wone kamiye tam ikare ma en pud kwo, ci en openyogi ni, “Wun wumiya kit tam ango wek adok iye bot lwak man?” <verse eid="1KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Gin guwaco ni, “Kace tin imito bedo latic pa lwak man kun itiyo pi konyogi, ci i lok botgi lok mabeco ikare ma ibidok iye i penygi, ci gin bene gibibedo lutici matwal.” <verse eid="1KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Ento en obwoto tam pa ludongo muteggi woko, ocako dok kaporo lok ki awobe ma yalwake, ma gimiye tam. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Openyogi ni, “Wun wumiya kit tam ango wek adok iye ki lwak man ma gulega ni, ‘Wek yec ma woru oketo ikomwa mapeki obed yot’?” <verse eid="1KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Ci awobe ma yalwake guwaco ni, “Ibidok iye bot lwak ma gulegi kit man ni, ‘Woru yam omiyo yecwa odoko pek, ento in imii obed yot botwa;’ in ibidok iye ki gin kit man ni, ‘Nyig cinga kinong makato pyer wora. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Dong abitiyo kit man: wora yam oketo yec mapek ikomwu, an dong abimedo bedo mapek; wora yam opwodowu ki del anino, an abipwodowu ki yib oton.’”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Jeroboam ki lwak ducu gubino bot Rekoboam ikom nino me adeke, kit ma onongo rwot ocikogi. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Rekoboam odok i lega pa lwak ki gero, pien onongo oweko tam, ma ludongo muteggi gumiye woko. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />Oloko kwedgi kit ma awobe con guyubu ire kun waco ni, “Wora yam omiyo yecwu odoko pek, ento an abimedo bedo mapek makato. Wora yam opwodowu ki del anino an abipwodowu ki odo layib oton.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Gin ma omiyo rwot Rekoboam pe omedo ki winyo lok ma lwak oloko, pien Rwot aye otiyo man, wek loke ocobe kakare mayam con en oloko bot Jeroboam wod pa Nebat kun ocwalo Akija lanebi ma jo Cilo ceng ocito ci otito boteni.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 20:1">2 Cam 20:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inino meno jo Icrael guniang ni rwot pe owinyogi, ci lwak gudok iye bote ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“Wan watye ki wang pokwa ango ikom Daudi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Pe watye ki dul mo ikom latin pa Yece.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Dong wan jo Icrael wadok i kemawa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Wek Rekoboam dong oloo ot pa Daudi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Ci jo Icrael gupoke woko gudok i pacogi. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Ento Rekoboam odong kaloyo jo Icrael ma gibedo i lobo Juda.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Rwot Rekoboam dok ocwalo Adoram botgi, en ladit maloyo wi tic muroni, ci jo Icrael ma Kumalo gucele ki got guneke woko. Ci rwot Rekoboam orune oito i gadigadi lwenye oringo kwede woko wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Kitmeno jo Icrael ma Kumalo gujemo woko ikom luker me ot pa Daudi cake ki ikare meno nio kwede wa onyo.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Ka jo Icrael guwinyo ni Jeroboam dong odwogo, ci gucwalo kwena gulwonge, ci en obino bot lwak ma gucoke, cut lwak gukete me bedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael ducu. Pe tye ngati mo ma dok olubu kor ot pa Daudi, kono kaka pa Juda keken.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma lanebi Cemaya otito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2 Tek 11:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Ka Rekoboam odwogo cen i Jerucalem, ci ocoko jo ma kiyero mabeco ki i kaka pa Juda ducu ki i kaka pa Benjamin, buca mony ma lulweny alip miya acel ki pyere aboro, pi lweny ki jo me ot pa Icrael ducu ma tung kumalo wek kidwok ker bot Rekoboam wod pa Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Ento Rwot Lubanga dok oloko ki latice ma nyinge Cemaya kun waco ni, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Wac bot Rekoboam wod pa Solomon ma rwot me Juda, ki bot jo ducu me ot pa Juda, ki jo pa Benjamin, ki bot jo mukene ducu ni, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />‘Rwot owaco kuman ni, wun pe wubicito kalweny ikom lutuwu ma gin jo Icrael. Wek dano acel acel odok cen i pacone, pien lok man oa ki bota.’” Gin ducu guwinyo lok pa Rwot, ci gudok cen i pacogi, kit ma Rwot owaconi.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam omiyo jo Icrael gubwoto woro Lubanga i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Jeroboam ogero taun Cekem i lobo godi me Epraim, ci obedo kunu; ka dok oa ki kunu ocito ogero taun Penuel. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Ka dok ocako lwodo lok ki i cwinye ni, “Kit matye ni, ker bidok woko cen i ot pa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Pien kace lwak gibedo kawire awira katyero gitum wa i Jerucalem kama Ot pa Rwot tye iyeni, ci bimiyo cwiny lwak man bidok woko ikom rwotgi Rekoboam ma rwot me Juda, ci miyo kibineka woko ka gidok bot Rekoboam rwot me Juda.” <verse eid="1KI 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Nia 32:4</ref></char></note>Kitmeno Jeroboam ocako yubu lok ci otiyo cal lutino twoni aryo me jabu, ka owaco bot lwak ni, “Wun dong wubedo kawire wa i Jerucalem tutwal, meno dong oromowu. Dong wunen lubangawu, wun jo Icrael, mayam en okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Jeroboam oketo cal wod twon acel i Betel, ka dok oketo acel i Dan.<verse eid="1KI 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Lok man odoko bal, pien jo Icrael gucako mol gucito bot wod twon acel matye i Betel, ki bot mukene matye i Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Jeroboam dok ogero odi me woro Lubanga iwi godi, kun keto iye ajwaki ma okwanyogi ki ikin lwak ata, ma pe gin jo Levi. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-34">Lev 23:33-34</ref></char></note>Dok oketo nino madit obedo i dwe me aboro, ikom nino dwe apar wiye abic, marom ki nino madit ma bedo i Judani, ci ocako tyero gitum ikom keno tyer. Obedo katiyo kitmeno i Betel, kun tyero gitum bot cal lutino twoni ma en otiyoni. Dok oketo i Betel ajwaki ma okwanyo ki i kabedo me woro Lubanga iwi godi ma en oyubuni. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Jeroboam ceng obino i Betel i dwe me aboro, inino dwe apar wiye abic, inino ma cwinye omokoni; ci oito malo kene ikom keno tyer kawango iye odok eceta inino madit pi jo Icrael ducu ma tung kumalo.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lanebi ma oa ki i Juda ojuku Jeroboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Dano pa Lubanga mo oa ki i Juda ma Rwot ocwalo ki loke wa i Betel, kama Jeroboam onongo ocung iye kanget keno tyer kawango odok eceta. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15-16">2 Luk 23:15-16</ref></char></note>Dano meno ocako lok ki gero kun tito lok pa Lubanga ikom keno tyernu. Kun waco ni, “Ai keno tyer, keno tyer, Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Nen ba, kibinywalo latin laco i ot pa Daudi ma nyinge Yocia. Ajwaki me kabedo me woro Lubanga ma iwi godi ma gibedo kawango odok eceta ikomi en binekogi woko ikomi macalo gitum, ki cogo pa dano bene kibiwangogi ikomi.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />En omiyo lanyut inino meno kun waco ni, “Man aye bibedo gin ma nyutu ni Rwot aye oloko lok man: keno tyeri bimuke woko, ki buru ma i wiyeni bionye woko piny.” <verse eid="1KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Ikare ma rwot Jeroboam owinyo lok ma dano pa Lubanga ma owaco ki tek kun loko bene ki gero ikom keno tyer man ma i Beteli, ci rwot oryeyo cinge ki i kanget keno tyer kun waco ni, “Wumaka danonu woko.” Ci bade ma oryeyo pi cimo danonu otugi tal woko cut, ma dolone wek odwog cen i kore oloye woko. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Ki keno tyerni bene otugi muk woko, ki buru bene otugi uke woko piny nia ki iwi keno tyer. Kumeno lanyut me lok pa Rwot ma dano pa Lubanga otitoni ocobe kakare. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Jeroboam owaco bot dano pa Lubanga ni, “Leg Rwot Lubangani kombedi, wek odwok cwinye, ka dong ileg pira, wek bada odole odwog ikoma kakare.” Dano pa Lubanga olego Rwot, ci bad rwot odole odwogo cen kakare, obedo kit macon ca.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />I nge meno rwot dok owaco bot lanebi pa Lubanga ni, “Bin dong wacit paco, wek i cit iywe kunu, ci abimiyi mot mo me pwoc.” <verse eid="1KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Ento lanebi pa Rwot ogamo dog rwot ni, “Kadi bed i miya nucu jami ducu ma i odi kulu, pe abiye donyo i odi wan kwedi. Dok pe abicamo kwon kadi wa mato piigu ki i kabedo man; <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />pien Rwot ocika kitmeno, ma en waco ni, ‘In pe ibicamo kwon kadi wa mato piigu ki kunu, dok pe ibidwogo cen ki yoo ma i cito kwede kunu.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Kitmeno en okwanyo yoo mukene; pe odok cen ki yoo ma ocito kwede i Beteli.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Onongo bene tye lanebi mo ma otii ma bedo i Betel. Awobene gucito gutite gin ducu ma dano pa Lubanga otiyo i Betel inino meno; ki lok ma oloko bot rwot bene gutito bot won gi. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Ci won gi openyogi ni, “En kono okwanyo yoo mene?” Awobene gunyute yoo ma dano pa Lubanga ma oa i Judani odok kwede cen. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Ci owaco bot awobene ni; “Wutwena kom me bedo iwi kana.” Gutwene kom me bedo iwi kanane, ci en obedo i wiye. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Ocito kwede i kor dano pa Lubanganu ci ononge obedo ite yat kworo. Ka openye ni, “In aye i dano pa Lubanga ma oa i Judani?” Ci en ogamo ni, “An do!” <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Dok owace ni, “Bin wacit paco kacel kweda kacamo kwon.” <verse eid="1KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Ento dano pa Lubanga ogame ni, “Pe myero adok kwedi cen, nyo adony kwedi wa i otwu, dok pe abicamo kwon kwedi kadi wa mato piigu i kabedo man; <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />pien ceng Rwot oloko bota ma ocika matek ni. ‘In pe ibicamo kwon kadi wa mato piigu kunu, dok pe ibidwogo ki yoo ma icito kwede kunu.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Lanebi ma otii ca ogamo doge ni, “An bene lanebi macalo in, dok lamalaika pa Rwot ociko an ki lok man ni; Rwot owaca ni, ‘Cit icidwog ki lanebi ca paco, en obin kacel kwedi wa i odi wek ocam kwon ka omat piigu.’” Ento onongo en obedo ka bwolo dano ca abwola. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Ci lanebi ca odok cen kacel kwede, ci ocamo kwon i ode, ka omato piigu. <verse eid="1KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Ikare ma gubedo kacam iwi meja, Rwot Lubanga oloko bot lanebi mutii ca ma omiyo lawote odwogo cen i odeni. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Lanebi mutii ni ocako lok ki gero bot dano pa Lubanga ma oa ki i Juda kun wace ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘In pe iworo dog Rwot, dok pe i mako cik ma Rwot Lubangani ociki kwede. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Pimeno nen in i ye dwogo woko cen, dok icamo kwon ki bene imato piigu i kabedo mayam awaco ki in ni icit iye ento pe omyero i cam kwon kadi wa mato piigu! In dong pe kibiyiko komi i lyel pa kwariwu.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Ka dong gutyeko cam ki mat, won ot otweyo kom me bedo iwi kanane pi lanebi ma en omiyo odwogo cen ni. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Ka dano meno ocito, labwor mo orwate kwede i yoo, ci omake oneke woko. Kome obutu i yoo kun kana ocung kangete, ki labwor bene ocung kanget kom danonu. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Dano ma gukato ki kangete guneno kom dano ma obutu i yoo, ki labwor ma ocung kanget kom danoni. Gubino gutito pire i taun madit ma lanebi mutii bedo iyeni.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Ikare ma lanebi ma omiyo dano ca odwogo cen ni owinyo pire, ci owaco ni, “Meno aye dano pa Lubanga ma pe oworo lok pa Rwot; oweko Rwot omiye i cing labwor ma okaye oneke wokoni, kit macalo Rwot oloko kwede bote.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Ci owaco bot awobene ni, “Dong wutwe kom iwi kana,” ci gutweyo kom iwi kana. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Ci lanebi ma otiini ocito onongo kom danonu obutu i yoo, kun kana ki labwor gucung kanget kome. Labwor bene pe omwodo kome, pe okayo kana bene. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Lacen Lanebi ma otiini otingo kom dano pa Lubanga ni, oketo iwi kanane, ci okelo kome igange, wek gukum pire ka kiyik kome. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ka Lanebi meno oyiko kom dano pa Lubanga i lyele kikome; ci gukumu pire kun giwaco ni, “Can madit opoto ikomi do, omera!” <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Ka dong kityeko yiko kome, ci lanebinu ociko awobene ni, “Ka an dong ato, ci wuyika i lyel ma kiyiko iye kom dano pa Lubangani, wuket cogona kanget cogone. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Pien lok ma en ogere kwede ma teki onongo lok pa Rwot ma oloko ikom keno tyer ma i Betel, ki ikom odi ducu ma i kabedo me woro Lubanga ma gitye i taun ducu ma i Camaria. Loke ducu bicobe kakare ada.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />I nge lok man ma otime ni Jeroboam pe omedo ki weko kite maracuni. En dok omede ki keto ajwaki me tic i kabedo me woro Lubanga ma iwi godi ma okwanyogi ki ikin lwak ata. Teke onongo ngat mo keken ma mito bedo ajwaka, ci kwero en wek obed ajwaka cut, ci keto i ka woro Lubanga ma iwi godini. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Kit tim macalo man aye odoko bal ikom jo me ot pa Jeroboam, ma omiyo ode kikwanyo woko nio ka kityeko woko liweng ki iwi lobo man.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">To pa wod pa Jeroboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Ikare meno two omako Abija wod pa Jeroboam. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Jeroboam owaco ki dakone ni, “Cit iruk bongoni mapat wek pe ngat mo onen ni in i dako pa Jeroboam, ci i cit wa i Cilo. Akija ma lanebini tye kunu, en aye yam owaco bota ni abibedo rwot maloyo lwak man. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Ber i tere mugati apar, ki capat bene, ki agulu moo kic, wek icit kwede bote, ci en bititi gin ma bitime ikom latin.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Dako pa Jeroboam otimo kitmeno, en oa ocito wa i Cilo ci ki kunu ocito odonyo i ot pa Akija. Akija onongo dong pe twero neno piny, pien wange dong ocor woko pi tiyone. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Rwot Lubanga owaco bot Akija ni, “Nen ba, dako pa Jeroboam tye kabino boti. Obibino kapenyo dogi pi two pa wode, pien two omako malit.” Ci Rwot otito bote lok ducu ma omyero owac bot dakonu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:5">Ka dako meno obino, en onongo oloke odoko macalo dako ma oa ki kamukene. <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Ento ka Akija owinyo kor tyene ikare ma en bino kwede i dogolane, ci otugi jole ni, “Dony ba, in dako pa Jeroboam. Pingo i loke idoko macalo dako ma oa ki kamukene? Rwot ocika ki lok mapek ikomi. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />In idok icit itit bot Jeroboam ni, Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, ‘An yam apilo wii aketi kwede i dit, ma kun akwanyi ki ikin lwak, ci aketi ibedo lalo lwaka ma gin jo Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Yam amayo ker woko ki i ot pa Daudi, amiyo boti; ento in pe ibedo macalo latica Daudi mayam omako cika ducu, kun lubu kora ki cwinye ducu, dok tiyo gin manen atir keken i wanga. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />In aye dong itiyo bal ma okato jo ducu ma gukwongo nyimi, kun itiyo lwak lubanga piri keni, ki cal lubanga aliyagu ma omiyo kiniga omaka, dok ityeko bola woko i yo ngeyi. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:29">1 Luk 15:29</ref></char></note>Pieno abiketo can ikom jo me odi, in Jeroboam, abineko co ducu ma i odi ma i lobo Icrael, opii wa ki anywali. Abijwero jo ma i odi ducu atyekogi woko liweng, kit macalo dano wango cet dyang nio ka owango okur woko liwengi. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Danoni ducu ma gibito i taun madito, gwogi aye bimwodo komgi; ento dano ma gibito i dye tim ata, winyo aye bicamogi, an Rwot aye dong atyeko loko kitmeno.’”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ci Akija owaco bot dako pa Jeroboam ni, “In dong ia, icit i odi. Kace tyeni odonyo i taun, ci latin bito woko. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Jo Icrael ducu gibikumu pire, ka kiyiko kome. En kene aye kibiyiko kome i lyel ki ikin jo pa Jeroboam, pien en kene aye ikin jo me ot pa Jeroboam ma Rwot Lubanga me Icrael onongo tye ki yomcwiny ikome. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Rwot bikwanyo dano mo mukene ma bibedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael, en aye dano ma bityeko ot pa Jeroboam woko ikare meno. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Lacen Rwot dok bipwodo Icrael nio wang ma kome myel calo lagada ma kwang iwi pii. En biputu jo Icrael woko ki i lobo man maberi mayam omiyo bot kwarigi, ci bikeyogi woko ata loka kulu Euprate, pien gumiyo kiniga omako Rwot pi payo cal jok ma dako ma kilwongo ni Acera. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Rwot bibwoto Icrael woko pi bal pa Jeroboam ma en obalo, ka dok omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Dako pa Jeroboam oa ocako wot me cito i Tirja. Ka en oo i dogola ote ci latin otugi to woko cut. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Jo Icrael ducu gubino ka guyiko kome, ci gukumu pire kit mayam Rwot owaco i loke ki latice lanebi Akija.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Lok kom Jeroboam mudonge ducu, ki kit ma olwenyo kwede i monygu, ki kit loce ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Kare ma Jeroboam obedo kwede i loc oromo mwaka pyere aryo wiye aryo; ci oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine. Wode Nadab aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Rekoboam rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:5-12:15">2 Tek 11:5—12:15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Ikare meno Rekoboam wod pa Solomon obedo kaloyo lobo Juda. Rekoboam ocamo ker ma onongo mwaka me dite romo pyere angwen wiye acel, obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abiro. Jerucalem en aye gang mayam Rwot oyero ki ikin kaka ma i Icrael ducu pi keto iye nyinge wek ki wor. Nying min Rekoboam aye Naama, ma en anyira Ammon. <verse eid="1KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Jo Juda gutiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, ci gumiyo nyeko omake pi balgi ma gutiyo, ma okato bal mayam kwarigi gutiyo ducu. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:9-10">2 Luk 17:9-10</ref></char></note>Gugero wang jogigi iwi godi, ki gucibo wir jogigu ki cal jok ma dako ma kilwongoni Acera ki iwi godi mabocone ducu, iwi cere, iwang ayweya, ki ma ite yadi ma potgi oluk. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:17">Nwo 23:17</ref></char></note>I lobogi onongo tye iye bene co ki mon ma lutim kwele ikom wadigi iwang jogi. Lwak gutiyo kit tim kipyeda ducu marom ki bal pa rok mayam Rwot oryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icraeli.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />I mwaka me loc pa Rekoboam me abice en aye Cicak rwot me Ejipt obino iye kalweny ikom Jerucalem. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:16-17">1 Luk 10:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:15-16">2 Tek 9:15-16</ref></char></note> En oyako jami ma kikano i ot lim pa Lubanga, ki jami ma kikano i ot lim pa rwot. Oyako lwak jami ki i lobo woko ducu kadi wa lwak kwot me jabu mayam Solomon otiyogi. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Rekoboam dok otiyo lwak kwot mukene ma kakagi; man en otiyo ki mola ci omiyogi i cing ludito ma lugwok rwot, ma gigwoko wa dogola ot pa rwot. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Ikare ducu ma nongo rwot cito i Ot pa Lubanga, lugwok en gimako kwot i cinggi, ka dok ki dwokogi kakagi i ot kicika pa lugwok rwot.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Lok kom Rekoboam mudonge, ki gin ma en otiyo ducu kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. </char> <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Lweny obedo ikin Rekoboam ki Jeroboam kare mapol. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Rekoboam oto oywe kacel ki kwarine ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa Daudi. Nying mine Naama ma en obedo anyira Ammon. Ci wode Abijam aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Abijam rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2 Tek 13:1—14:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat en aye Abijam ocako loyo iye jo Juda. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka adek. Nying mine Maaka ma nya pa Abcalom. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />En yam otimo kit bal ducu ma wone ma otelo nyime otiyo; en pe obedo ki lengic ikom Rwot Lubangane kit mayam kwarone Daudi obedo kwede. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Luk 11:36</ref></char></note>Kadi bed kumeno, Rwot Lubangane oweko mar mere obedo i Jerucalem pi Daudi, kun bene omiyo wode aye oleyo katyene, dok Rwot omiyo Jerucalem ocung matek ite gwok mere ki ikom lukwore. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1-27">2 Cam 11:1-27</ref></char></note>Rwot yam otiyo man ducu pien Daudi otimo gin manen atir i wange. En pe oweko lubu gin ducu mayam Rwot ociko ikare me kwone, ento oroco i lok kom Uria ma Lakit keken. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Lweny ma ocake ikin Rekoboam ki Jeroboam omede o wa ikare me kwo pa Abijam ducu. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Lok kom Abijam mudonge ducu, ki gin ma en otiyo ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. </char> Lweny obedo ikin Abijam ki Jeroboam. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abijam oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i gangkal pa Daudi. Wode Aca aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Aca rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 15:16-16:6">2 Tek 15:16—16:6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />I mwaka me pyere aryo me loc pa Jeroboam rwot me Icrael en aye i mwakanu rwot Aca ocako loyo iye jo Juda. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />En obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere angwen wiye acel. Nying mine Maaka ma nya pa Abcalom. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Aca otiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot kit ma kwarone Daudi yam otiyoni. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />En oryemo co ki mon ma lutim kwele kama giworo iye jogigi ki i lobone, ka dok okwanyo cal jogi ducu mayam kwarine gutiyo. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Aca okwanyo wa mine Maaka woko dok pe oyeni omede kibedo daker, pien onongo ikare meno Maaka omiyo ni ki tiine cal me kipyeda pi Acera ma jok ma dako; ci Aca otongo cal joke ongido woko, ci owango woko i laora kulu Kidron. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Ento wang jogi ma iwi godi pe ki mukugi woko. Kadi bed kumeno, Aca obedo ki lagen ikom Rwot pi kare me kwone ducu. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />En okelo i Ot pa Rwot mot mayam wone odyero bot Lubanga, kacel ki mere kikome bene ma odyero, ryal ki jabu ki weergu.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aca oribe ki Ben-adad</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 16:1-14">2 Tek 16:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Lweny obedo ikin Aca ki Baaca rwot me Icrael pi kare me kwogi ducu. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Baaca rwot me Icrael otugu lweny ikom Juda, ci ogero gang me Rama, wek ogeng dano mo pe okat woko ki i lobo Juda nyo odonyo iye kun nongo oa ki bot Aca rwot me Juda. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Aca okwanyo jami ducu me ryal ki me jabu ma onongo odong i ot kano lim pa Rwot Lubanga, ki jami ma i Ot kano lim ma mere en rwot, ci omiyogi i cing lutice, kun cwalogi kwede bot Ben-adad wod pa Tabrimmon, wod pa Kejion rwot me Ciria ma bedo i Damaciko, kun waco bote ni, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Wek waket gicike mo ikinwa an ki in, kit mayam obedo ikin kwara ki kwaru. Nen ba, an dong acwali ryal ki jabu me mot; ber icit itur gicikewu ki Baaca rwot me Icrael, wek en oa woko ki i lobona.” <verse eid="1KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Ci Ben-adad owinyo dog rwot Aca, ocwalo ludito wi monye kalweny ikom taun madito pa jo Icrael, ci omayo Ijon, Dan, Abel-bet-maaka ki lobo Kinerot ducu, ki lobo pa jo Naputali ducu. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Ka Baaca owinyo pire, ci obwoto gero Rama woko, odok obedo mere i Tirja. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Rwot Aca olwongo jo Juda ducu ka dong ociko ni ngat mo pe odong, ci guyweko godi ki bao ma i Rama ducu, ma onongo Baaca obedo ka gero ki Rama ni; ci rwot Aca ocako gero kwede gang me Geba ma i lobo pa jo Benjamin, ki Mijpa.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Lok kom Aca mudonge ducu, teke ducu ki gin ducu ma en ceng otiyo, ki taun ma ogerogi, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. </char> Ento ikare me tiyone aye two mo omako tyene ikare meno. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Aca oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa kwarone Daudi. Yekocapat ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Nadab rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Nadab wod pa Jeroboam ocako loyo lobo Icrael ma kumalo i mwaka me aryo me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda, ci oloyogi pi mwaka aryo. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />En otiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, pien obedo kalubu kit pa wone, ki pi bale ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baaca wod pa Akija ma oa i dog ot pa Icakar opiro lok ikom Nadab, ci ocobe oneke woko i Gibeton ma gang pa jo Piliciti. Onongo Nadab ki jo Icrael ducu gurumu taun madito me Gibeton woko. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baaca oneko Nadab i mwaka me adek me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda, ci oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Luk 14:10</ref></char></note>Ka dong otyeko doko rwot, ci oneko jo me dog ot pa Jeroboam woko ducu. Baaca pe dok oweko dano mo obwot ki ikin gi, nio ka orido wi jo ot pa Jeroboam woko liweng, kit mayam Rwot owaco ki i dog latice Akija lanebi me Cilo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Can meno opoto pi bal pa Jeroboam mayam obaloni, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubalo, dok pien omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Lok kom Nadab mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu mayam en otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Lweny obedo ikin Aca ki Baaca rwot me Icrael pi kare me kwogi ducu.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Baaca rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />I mwaka me adek me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda en aye Baaca wod pa Akija ocako loyo iye jo Icrael ducu ki i Tirja, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />En otiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, pien obedo kalubu kit pa Jeroboam, ki bale ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubaloni.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Ikare me loc pa Baaca Rwot Lubanga oloko bot latice Yeko wod pa Kanani ma okemo kom Baaca kun waco ni, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Ikare ma apilo wii aketo in i doko dit, ma kun akwanyo in ki i apwa ci aketo in ibedo latel wi jona jo Icrael, ci nen in i cako lubu kit pa Jeroboam, imiyo jona jo Icrael bene gudoko lubalo, omiyo kiniga omaka ikomgi pi balgi ducu. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Nen ba, abiyweyi woko in Baaca ki jo me odi ducu liweng, dok abimiyo odi bedo calo ot pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Danoni ducu ma gibito ki i taun madit, gwogi aye bimwodo komgi, ki dano ma gibito ki i dye tim ata, winyo aye bicamogi.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Lok kom Baaca mudonge ducu, ki gin ma en otiyo, ki teke, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Baaca oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i Tirja. Ela ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Lok pa Rwot ma ceng oloko bot lanebi Yeko wod pa Kanani ma okemo Baaca ki jo ma i ode obedo pi gin ma en otimo ma onen marac iwang Rwot. En omiyo kiniga omako Rwot ikome pi gin ma ceng otiyo marom ki kit tim pa Jeroboam, ki dok bene pien en oneko jo me ot pa Jeroboam woko ducu.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa rwot Ela me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />I mwaka me pyere aryo wiye abicel me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda en aye Ela wod pa Baaca ocako loyo iye jo Icrael ki i Tirja, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka aryo. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Ento latice Jimri, ma ladit maloyo nucu gadigadi lwenye, opiro lok ikome. Ikare ma Ela tye i Tirja en obedo kamat ci omer woko i ot pa Arja ma lalo jami ma i ode ma i Tirja. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Ci Jimri odonyo i ot, ocobo Ela otugi neko woko cut, i mwaka me pyere aryo wiye abiro me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda, ci Jimri oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Cutcut ka Jimri ocako loyo lobo Icrael, oneko jo me ot pa Baaca woko liweng; pe oweko latin laco mo makwo ki i dogolagi, kadi wa lureme bene. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Ci Jimri oneko jo me ot pa Baaca otyeko woko ducu kitmeno, kit ma Rwot yam owaco con ki i dog lanebi Yeko ma kemo lok kom Baaca, <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />pi bal pa Baaca ducu ki pi bal pa Ela ma wode, ma gin gubalo ka dok gumiyo jo Icrael bene gubalo, omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga me Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Lok kom Ela mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu ma en otiyo, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char><verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Jimri rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />I mwaka me pyere aryo wiye abiro me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda en aye Jimri obedo kaloc i Tirja pi nino abiro. Onongo mony pa jo Icrael gutongo gonygi ma gikemo Gibeton ma taun madit pa jo Piliciti, <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />ci lumony guwinyo ki i gonygi ni Jimri opiro lok, oneko rwot woko. En aye lok ma omiyo jo Icrael ducu guketo Omri ma ladit me mony aye odoko rwot maloyo Icrael inino meno ikare ma gitye i gony kunu. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Omri oa woko ki i Gibeton ki jo Icrael ducu kacel kwede, ci guwoto gurumu taun madit me Tirja. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Ka Jimri oneno ni mony dong omako taun madit woko, ci owoto i gogo me ot pa rwot, ka owango ot i wiye kene, ci oto iye. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Jimri oto pi bale ma otiyo dok pi tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot kun lubu kit pa Jeroboam ki bale ma con omiyo jo Icrael gubaloni. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Lok kom Jimri mudonge ducu, ki lok ma en opiro, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char><verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Omri rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Ikare meno onongo jo Icrael gupoke woko i dul aryo; nucu lwak tungcel aye gudok ikom Tibni wod pa Ginat pi keto en me bedo rwotgi, ki nucu tungcel gupoke gudok ikom Omri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Ento lwak ma gudok ikom Omri guloyo lwak ma gudok ikom Tibni wod pa Ginat; kitmeno Tibni oto woko, ci Omri odoko rwot. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />I mwaka me pyere adek wiye acel me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda en aye Omri ocako loyo iye jo Icrael, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka apar wiye aryo, kun oloyo mwaka abicel i Tirja. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Ci owilo got me Camaria ki bot Cemer ki lim ryal maromo talanta aryo, ka ogero iye taun gogo matek, ocako nyinge ni Camaria, macalo nying Cemer mayam obedo won got meno.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Omri otiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, dok otiyo gin marac makato jo ma gutelo nyime ducu. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />En obedo kalubu kit pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat ducu, ki bal ducu ma en omiyo jo Icrael gubalo, kun gumiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael pi cal jogigi. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Lok kom Omri mudonge ducu, ki gin ma en otiyo, ki teke ducu, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omri oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i Camaria; Akab ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Akab rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />I mwaka me pyere adek wiye aboro me loc pa Aca rwot me Juda en aye Akab wod pa Omri ocako loyo iye jo Icrael, ci obedo kaloc i Camaria pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Akab wod pa Omri otiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot makato rwodi ducu ma gutelo nyime. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Dok macalo en otamo pire kene ni lubu kit bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat obedo gin manok mo, omiyo en ocito i Cidon ci onyomo Jejebel ma nya pa Etibaal rwot pa jo Cidon, ka dok en bene ocito kunu ci oryebe inyime kun oworo jok Baal. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Ka en ogero ot pi jok Baal i Camaria, ci ocano iye keno tyer. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Akab ocibo cal jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera, dok otiyo gin ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael makato luker me Icrael ducu ma gutelo nyime. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Yoc 6:26</ref></char></note>I karene aye Kiel, dano me Betel, ogero iye Jeriko odoco. Abiram ma latin kayone okwongo to ci oketo gutine i wiye, ci wode matidine oto, ma nyinge Cegub, ka ki gero dog cel i wiye, macalo lok ma Rwot yam oloko ki i dog Yocwa wod pa Nun.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya ojuku cwer pa kot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:17">Yak 5:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Eliya Laticbe, ma taun Ticbe ma i Gilead, owaco bot rwot Akab ni, “An akwongo i nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael matye makwoni, ma an acung inyime, i mwaka ma binoni toyo bibedo peke kadi wa kot bene, nio ka doga aye dok bilokone.” <verse eid="1KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Ci Rwot Lubanga oloko bot Eliya ni, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“A woko ki kany, i dok tung kunyango, i cit i kane inget laora kulu Kerit ma inget kulu Jordan tung kunyango. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />I bimato pii ma i kulunu, dok atyeko ciko winyo agak ma gibipiti ki kunu.” <verse eid="1KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Eliya ocito kit ma Rwot oloko boteni, en ocito ci obedo inget laora kulu Kerit matye tung kunyango me kulu Jordan. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Ci agak gumede kitero kwon ki ringogu bote i odiko, ka dok otyeno bene gumede ki tere kwon ki ringogu. En obedo kamato pii ma i kulu Kerit. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Lacen pii ma i kuluni otwo woko, pien kot onongo dong pe tye kacwer i lobo.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya ki dato me Jarepat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ci Rwot dok oloko lok man bot Eliya ni, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:25-26">Luk 4:25-26</ref></char></note>“A malo, wek icit wa i Jarepat, macok ki Cidon, wek icit ibed kunu. Atyeko ciko dako mo kunu ma cware oto me miyo ki in cam.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Ci Eliya oa malo ocito i Jarepat. Ka en oo cok ki dog taun meno ci nen, dato mo tye obedo ka coko yen rido. Ci Eliya olwonge kun waco bote ni, “Alegi icit ikela pii mo i agwata wek amati.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Ka dakonu ocako wote me cito ka kele pii, ci dok olwonge kun wace ni, “Cit ikela kwon mo manok i cingi bene.” <verse eid="1KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Ci dakonu ogamo doge kun waco ni, “Akwongo inying Rwot Lubangani matye makwoni, pe atye ki mugati mo. Ento atye ki moko ngano pong cing acel keken ma odong ite agulu moko kwon, ki moo tedo mo manok ite atabo moo. Atye ka coko rido yen mogo wek adok kwede ka wek acit ated pira ki pi woda, ka dong wacam ci wato.” <verse eid="1KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Ento Eliya ogamo ni, “Pe ilwor, cit i tim kit ma iwaco ni; ento kong i teda mugati manok i kela, ka dok lacen icit ited piri ki pi wodi. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Pien Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, ‘Moko nganoni pe bitum woko ki i agulu moko kwon, ki mooni pe bitum woko i atabone, nio ka Rwot ocwalo kot ocwer i lobo.’” <verse eid="1KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Dakonu ocito otedo kit ma Eliya owace ni, ci dakonu ki Eliya ki jo ma i ode ducu gubedo ka camone pi nino mapol, <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />kun moko ngano pe tum ki i agulu moko kwon, moo bene pe orem i atabo, kit ma Rwot owaco ki i dog Eliya ni.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Lacen ki inge lok man, latin pa dakonu two omako, ci twone omede ma lit mada, nio ka oto. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Ci dakonu owaco bot Eliya ni, “I tima rac kuman pingo, in dano pa Lubanga? I bino bota ka poyo wiya i bala ma con, omiyo bala oneko woda woko do!” <verse eid="1KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Ento Eliya owaco bot dakonu ni, “Miya wodi kany.” Ci otingo latin woko ki i kor mine, ocito kwede i kicika mamalo kama en butu iye, ci opyelo latin iwi kabutune kikome. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ka ocako kok bot Rwot ni, “Ai Rwot Lubangana, in aye dok i kelo can ikom dato ma abedo boteni pi neko wode?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:34-35">2 Luk 4:34-35</ref></char></note>Ci Eliya oryene ikom latin tyen adek, kun kok kwede bot Rwot ni, “Ai Rwot Lubangana, wek tipu kom latin man odwog cen ikome ba!” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Ci Rwot owinyo koko pa Eliya, omiyo tipu kom latin odwogo cen ikome. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Ci Eliya otingo latin ki i kicika mamalo, okele i ot ma piny bot mine, ka owaco ni, “Nen, wodi tye makwo ene.” <verse eid="1KI 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Dakonu owaco bot Eliya ni, “Ai rwoda, kombedi dong angeyo atir ni in i dano pa Lubanga, dok lok pa Rwot ma iwaco ki dogi bene bedo me ada.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya odok onyute bot Akab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />I nge kare malac ka mwaka adek dong okato, ci Rwot Lubanga dok omiyo loke bot Eliya, kun owace ni, “Cit inyute kekeni bot Akab; ci itite ni Rwot owaco ni, ‘Nen dong abicwalo kot i lobo.’” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Ci Eliya ocito kanyute bot Akab. I karenu onongo kec dong odoko tek i Camaria. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Akab olwongo Obadia ma ladit maloyo jami ma i ode. (Onongo Obadia obedo dano ma woro Rwot matek tutwal. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Ikare mayam Jejebel tye kaneko lunebi pa Rwot, Obadia otero lunebi miya acel kulu, okanogi woko i boro, kun en opoko kin gi pyere abic pyere abic, ci opitogi ki cam ka omiyo ki gin pii bene.) <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Akab owaco bot Obadia ni, “Wot icit i dye lobo ducu kama wang it me pii tye iye, wa i nota kulu ducu; gwok nyo wabinongo iye lum wek walar aguragura ki kana gubed makwo, wek leewa mogo pe guto woko.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Ci gin gucako poko lobo ikin gi kama ngat acel acel biwot cito iye. Ci Akab ocito mere tungcel en kene, ki Obadia bene odok tungcel en kene.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Ikare ma Obadia tye kawot i yoo ci nen, Eliya otuc, orwate kwede. Obadia otugi ngeye woko cut, ci opoto piny aryeba cwiny kun waco ni, “Man aye in kikomi Eliya, rwoda?” <verse eid="1KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Ci Eliya ogamo doge ni, “Eyo, man an kikoma. Ento cit itit bot rwodi ni Eliya tye kany.” <verse eid="1KI 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Ci Obadia ogamo loke ni, “An abalo kit bal ango boti, rwoda? Pingo imito miya i cing Akab wek oneka? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Akwongo kwong inying Rwot Lubangani matye makwoni, pe tye rok mo nyo ker mo ma rwoda Akab pe ocwalo iye dano kayenyo in. Ka gudwoko lok ni, ‘Eliya pe tye kany,’ en kong miyo ladit me rok meno nyo me ker meno kwongo kwong ma nyutu ni pe gunongi kunu. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Ci in dok iwaco ni, ‘Wot icit bot rwodi icitite ni Eliya tye kany?’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Ka ki i ngeya ma nongo dong acito woko, ce Cwiny pa Rwot otingi woko ci oteri kama pe angeyo kono? Pieno, ka acito atito bot Akab, kace pe kinongo komi, ci en bineka woko, kadi bed abedo ka woro dog Rwot cake ka tinona. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Peya kitito boti ce, rwoda, gin ma abedo katiyone ikare ma Jejebel tye kaneko lunebi pa Rwot? Yam akano lunebi pa Rwot miya acel kulu i boro, kun apoko kin gi pyere abic pyere abic, ci abedo ka miyogi cam ki pii bene. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Ka in dok iwaco ni, ‘Wot itit bot rwodi ni Eliya tye kany,’ man miyo en bineka woko.” <verse eid="1KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya ogamo lok pa Obadia ni, “Akwongo kwong ki nying Rwot me mony matye makwoni, ma an acung inyime, ni abinyutu koma bote tin atina inyime.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Ci Obadia ocito karwate ki Akab, ka otite lok meno, ci Akab oa ocito karwate ki Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ka Akab oneno kom Eliya, ci owaco bote ni, “Man en in kikomi, in ma lakel ayela i Icrael tutwali!” <verse eid="1KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Ci Eliya ogamo doge ni, “An aye pe layel Icrael; in aye itye kayelone, in ki jo me dogola pa woru, pien wun wubwoto lubu Cik pa Rwot woko, dok wutye ka woro Baal. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Kombedi in dong icwal kwena wek icok jo Icrael ducu inyima iwi got Karmel. Cok ki lunebi pa jok Baal bene miya angwen ki pyere abic, ki lunebi miya angwen pa Acera ma jok ma dakoni ma gicamo cam iwi meja pa Jejebel.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya opyem ki lunebi pa Baal iwi got Karmel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Akab ocwalo kwena bot jo Icrael ducu, ki bene en ocoko lunebi pa Baal ducu iwi got Karmel. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Ka Eliya ocito cok bot lwak ci owaco botgi lok man ni, “Wun mono wubicabe atata i cwinywu nio kwede wa awene? Kace Rwot aye Lubanga, ci wulub en keken; ento ka Baal, ci wutugi lubu en cut.” Ento lwak pe gudoke iye lok mo. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Eliya dok owaco bot lwak ni, “An kena aye pud adong ki ikom lunebi pa Rwot, kun lunebi pa Baal gitye miya angwen ki pyere abic kulu. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Wek kikel twoni aryo botwa kany. Wek lunebi pa Baal guyer twon acel obed meggi, wek gunek, gungid woko, ci gucan ringone iwi yen ma iwi keno tyer, ento pe gumok iye mac mo. Ki an bene abiyubu twon acel, ci abicano ringone iwi yen ma i keno tyer, ento pe abimoko iye mac mo. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Ci wun wuleg bot lubangawu, ki an bene abilego bot Rwot Lubangana; ci lubanga ma bidok iye ki cwalo mac, en aye Lubanga ada.” Lwak ducu gugamo ni. “I loko mamit.” <verse eid="1KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Eliya dok owaco bot lunebi pa Baal ni, “Wun wuyer twonwu acel wek wucak yubune; wun aye wukwong, pien wupol, ento pe wumok iye mac mo.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Ci lunebi pa Baal gukwanyo twon ma kimiyogini, guyubu, gulego Baal, cake odiko nio kwede wa i cwiny dyeceng, kun giwaco ni, “Ai Baal, dokiwa iye do ya!” Ento dwon mo pe ma winye, ki ngat mo ma dok ki gin iye bene peke. Gubedo kamyel ma girumu kwede keno tyer ma gucanoni. <verse eid="1KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Ci Eliya ocako cayogi i dyeceng kun waco ni, “Wudange matek, pien en aye lubanga. Gwok nyo iye pud tye kalwodo lok, nyo pud ocito woko, nyo pud tye i dog wote mo ba, nyo pud onino, ci myero kong wucoye woko ki iwang ninone.” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Ka dok gudange matek, kun gingolo komgi keken gi ki pala lucwan ki aterogu macalo kitgi tye kwede; gungole nio ka remo komgi ocako cwer kun mol. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Gubedo kadange matek dyeceng benebene kun gilego Baal nio wa i cawa me tyero gityer me otyeno, ento piny oling tik; ngat ma dok iye botgi peke, ki ngat ma paro pirgi bene peke.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Lacen Eliya owaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Wubin dong bota cok kany,” ci lwak ducu gucito bote cok. En ocako yubu keno tyer pa Rwot mayam kimuku kireto woko pinyi. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Aca 32:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:10">35:10</ref></char></note>Ci Okwanyo godi apar wiye aryo muporo wel kaka pa awobe pa Yakobo mayam Rwot oloko bote kun waco ni, “Nyingi bibedo Icrael.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Eliya ocano keno tyer ki godi meno pi woro nying Rwot. Ka dok okwinyo bur orumu nget keno tyer, ma tute romo tero pii lita apar wiye angwen. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Ka otyeko cano yen kikore, ci ongido ringo twon, ocano iwi yen. Ka dok en owaco ni, “Dong wutwom pii maromo abino angwen, ka wuony piine iwi gitum awanga, ki ikom yen gu bene.” <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Ka dok owaco ni, “Dok wumed onyo iye pii”; ci gunwoyo onyo pii tyen me aryone. Dok owaco ni, “Wumed tyen me adeke”; ci gumedo tyen me adeke. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Ci pii obedo ka mol kun rumu keno tyer, opongo i bur woko liweng.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Ka cawa me tyero gityer me otyeno dong oromo, lanebi Eliya onyiko cok ikom keno tyer, ci olego kit man ni, “Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Abraim, pa Icaka ki pa Icrael, wek tin dong ongene atir ni in aye Lubanga pa Icrael, dok ni an abedo latici, ci atiyo man ducu pi lok ma ceng iwaco bota. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Doka iye, ai Rwot, doka iye, wek lwak man gunge atir ni in Rwot aye in Lubanga keni, dok ni ityeko dwoko cwinygi ikomi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Ci Rwot ocwalo mac oa ki bote obino opoto piny, ci owango gitum awanga woko ducu liweng, ki yen gu bene liweng, ki godigu, ki daba, ka dok onango pii woko ma onongo opongo i buri. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Ka lwak ducu guneno man, ci gupoto woko piny aryeba cwiny, kun giwaco ni, “Rwot aye Lubanga; Rwot aye Lubanga!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Eliya dok owaco lok man bot lwak ni, “Wumak lunebi pa Baal ducu, pe wuwek mo obwot.” Kimakogi woko ducu, ci Eliya oterogi piny i laora kulu Kicon, kama onekogi woko ki kunu.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya olego pi kot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Eliya owaco bot Akab ni, “Cit dong kacam ki kamat, pien dwon kot ma mito cwer dong mor winye.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:18">Yak 5:18</ref></char></note>Akab oa ocito woko kacam ki kamat, ento Eliya oito malo iwi got Karmel, ka en olego kun okulu wiye piny i ngom ma orwako wiye ikin conge. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Ka owaco bot latice ni, “Cit inen tung nam.” Ka ocito woko oneno, ci owace ni, “Gin mo pud peke.” Eliya dok owace ni, “Cit dok odoco, ci en owire tyen abiro.” <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Ikom tyen me abirone latice owaco ni, “Aneno latin pol mo otinge ki i nam, tidi rom ki cing dano keken.” Ci Eliya dok owaco ni, “Cit bot Akab, wek iwace ni, ‘Yub gadigadi i dok gang wek kot pe ogengi wot.’” <verse eid="1KI 18:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Polo ocako cido woko ki pol oyotoyot tutwal, kun yamo kodo matek, ci kot ocako cwer madwong. Ci Akab oito iwi gadigadine ci odok i Jejreel. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Ento Rwot onongo otingo Eliya ki tek me cinge, omiyo otweyo pyere ci oringo kwede inyim Akab nio kwede wa i dog gang me Jejreel.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya oringo woko i Koreb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Akab otito bot dakone Jejebel gin ducu ma Eliya otimo, ki bene kit ma en oneko kwede lunebi pa jok Baal ducu ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Ci Jejebel ocwalo lakwenane bot Eliya kun wace ni, “Ka diki cawa ma kit man oromo ma pud peya nongo aneko in woko, kit ma i neko kwede lunebina wokoni, ci lubangana ma aworogini myero guket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Ci lworo omako Eliya woko, omiyo en oringo olaro kwone, ocito i Beer-ceba ma i lobo Juda, kama oweko latice iye kunu.<verse eid="1KI 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JON 4:3">Yon 4:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento en oa ocito kene i tim, owoto wot me nino acel kulu. Ka oo kunu ci en obedo ite yat laywe mo, kama en olego iye Rwot ni, “Dong oromo, ai Rwot, tin dong i kwany kwona woko; pien an pe aber akato kwarina ducu.” <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Ci en obutu mere woko piny ci otugi nino woko ite yat laywe meno. Ci nen, lamalaika pa Rwot ogudu kome, dok owaco bote ni, “Eliya, a malo wek i cam.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Ka oa oneno piny, ci oneno capat ma kitedo ikom got ma lyet, ki pii i abino matye ka wiye. Ci ocako camone ka dong omato pii, ci dok obutu piny. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Ci Lamalaika pa Rwot dok odwogo bote tyen me aryone; ci ogudu kome kun dok owace ni, “Eliya, a malo wek icam, ka dong imat pii, pien nen woti pud dit mada.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Ci Eliya oa malo, ocamo ka dok omato pii, ci olimo tek ma oa i cam meno omiyo omede ki wot pi nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor ci oo kwede wa i Koreb ma got pa Lubangani.<verse eid="1KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Ka oo kunu, ci odonyo i boro mo, obedo iye. Ci Rwot obino bote kun penye ni “I timo gin ango kany, Eliya?” <verse eid="1KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:3">Rom 11:3</ref></char></note>Ci Eliya ogamo doge ni, “Nyeko obedo kamaka mada pi Rwot, ma Lubanga me mony; pien jo Icrael gubwoto gicikeni woko, dok gumuku keno tyeri woko ducu, dok guneko lunebini woko ki pala lucwangu. An aye dong adong kena, dok bene gimito neka woko.” <verse eid="1KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Ka dok Rwot owaco bote ni, “Wot i cit anyim, wek icung iwi got inyim Rwot.” Ci nen, Rwot okato kangete kun yamo madwong mager tye kabaro godi, dok ongido lela matinotino inyim Rwot; ento Rwot onongo pe i yamonu. Ki inge yamo, oyengyeng obino, ento onongo Rwot pe tye i oyengyeng meno. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Ki inge oyengyeng mac obino, ento Rwot onongo pe tye i mac. Ki inge mac, dwon ma tidi mo obino. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Ka Eliya owinyo, ci oumu wange woko ki bongone, ci ocito kwede ocung i dog boro. Ci Nen, dwon oloko bote kun waco ni, “I timo gin ango kany, Eliya?” <verse eid="1KI 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Ci Eliya ogamo ni, “Nyeko aye obedo kamaka mada pi Rwot Lubanga me mony; pien jo Icrael gubwoto gicikeni woko, kun bene dok gumuku keno tyeri woko ducu, guneko lunebini ki pala Iucwangu, ci an aye dong adong kena, dok bene kimito neka woko.” <verse eid="1KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:7-13">2 Luk 8:7-13</ref></char></note> Ci Rwot owace ni, “Wot i dok cen kun i lubu yoo ma cito i tim me Damaciko. Ka io kunu, ci i biwiro Kajael wek obed rwot me Ciria. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:1-6">2 Luk 9:1-6</ref></char></note>Ka dok i biwiro Yeko wod pa Nimci obed rwot me Icrael; ka dok Elica wod pa Capat me Abel-mekola ibiwiro me bedo lanebi ma bileyo kakari. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Dong dano ma bibwot ki i pala lucwan pa Kajael, Yeko binekone; dok dano ma bibwot ki i pala lucwan pa Yeko, Elica binekone. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:4">Rom 11:4</ref></char></note>Ento abibwoto dano alip abiro i lobo Icrael, jo ducu ma peya gurumu conggi inyim jok Baal, ma doggi bene pe gunoto lem cal Baal pi nyutu worogi bote.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga olwongo Elica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Ka Eliya oa woko ki kunu, ci ocito onongo Elica wod pa Capat. Elica onongo tye kapur ki kweri dyang apar wiye aryo ma guryeyo inyime, ma twoni pur kiywayogi ki aryoaryo; en kikome aye tye ki me apar wiye aryone. Eliya okato ki kangete, ci obolo bongone ikome. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Ci Elica otugi weko twonine woko, ocako ngwec i kor Eliya kun waco ni, “Wek kong acit acik wora ki maa, ka dong adwogo ka alub kori.” Eliya ogamo doge ni, “Dok giri cen do, an kono atimo kit gin ango ikomi?” <verse eid="1KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Ci Elica oweko lubu kor Eliya, odok cen, ogonyo twonine aryo onekogi woko, ka otedo ringogi ki rii ngutgi ma ka yen, opoko bot dano ma gitye kunu, ci gucamo. Ka dong oa ocito kalubu kor Eliya, ci en ocako konye macalo latice.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Akab oloyo jo Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Ben-adad ma rwot pa jo Ciria ocoko monye ducu, ogurugi kacel, ma kun luker pyere adek wiye aryo bene gitye kwede, ki lwak aguragura ki gadigadi lwenygu. En otero monye orumu Camaria woko ka ocako lweny ikome. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Ci ocwalo lukwenane i taun madit bot Akab rwot me Icrael ka wace ni, “Ben-adad owaco kuman ni, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Ryali ki jabuni ducu mera; ki monni ma gibeconi ki lutinoni bene ducu mera.’” <verse eid="1KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Ci rwot me Icrael ogamo ni, “Ai rwot Ben-adad, in i rwoda, an a danoni, kacel ki jami ma atye kwedgi ducu meri.” <verse eid="1KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Lacen lukwenane gudok bot Akab tyen me aryone, kun giwaco ni, “Ben-adad owaco kuman ni, ‘Yam acwalo lok kun awaco ni imiya ryal ki jabuni, ki monni ki lutinoni. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Dong diki adika ikin ka cawa man abicwalo lutica boti, gibiyenyo i odi ki i odi pa lutici, ci gibimako gin ducu mayomo cwinygi ma gitye me wel, ci gibiyakone, gibiterone woko.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />I nge lok man rwot Akab me Icrael olwongo ludongo me lobone ducu, ka owaco botgi ni, “Kong wunen kit ma dano man tye kayenyo kwede kolo. En ceng ocwalo loke bota ni amiye monna ki lutinona, ki ryal ki jabugu, ci peya akwere iye lok mo.” <verse eid="1KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Ludongo ducu ki lwak ducu gugamo doge ni, “Pe itam gin mo ikom lokenu, pe iye bene.” <verse eid="1KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Ma omiyo rwot owaco bot lukwena pa Ben-adad ni, “Wun wucit wuwac bot rwoda rwot ni, ‘Gin ma ikwongo mitone ki bota abimiyone ducu, ento man aye pe atwero ye.’” Ci lukwena gudok ka tero loke. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Ben-adad cut ocwalo lok bot Akab kuman ni, “Abiloko Camaria doko apwa, ento apwane pe biromo lwak danona ma abibino kwedgi, ma wek ngat acel acel ojob pong cinge odwog kwede. Ka pe atimo kumeno, ci lubanga pa kwariwa myero guket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene.” <verse eid="1KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Ci rwot me Icrael ogamo doge ni, “Dano ma pud tye katweyo jami lweny i pyere me cito kalweny peya wake marom ki dano ma dong obilunyu jamine ma en dong otyeko lwenye woko.” <verse eid="1KI 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Ka Ben-adad owinyo lok man kun tye kamato kongone ki luker ma gitye kagony i bolone, ci owaco bot lwake ni, “Dong wucak rye i tyeng i kabedowu,” ci gurye i tyeng i kabedogi pi lweny ikom taun madit me Camaria.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />I cawa meno lanebi mo obino bot Akab rwot me Icrael ci owaco bote ni, “Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, ‘In dong ityeko neno lwak man madwongi? Pe ilwor pien tin abimiyogi i cingi, miyo ibingeyo atir ni An a Rwot.’” <verse eid="1KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ci Akab ogamo doge ni. “En bitic ki jo mene?” Ci lanebi ogamo ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, en bitic ki awobe ma gikonyo lulo dul lobo acel acel.” Ka Akab dok omede ki peny ni, “Anga ma bicako lweny?” Ci lanebi ogamo ni, “In.” <verse eid="1KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Ci Akab olwongo awobe ma gikonyo lulo dul lobo mapatpat; onongo giromo miya aryo ki pyere adek wiye aryo. Ka dok oryeyo jo Icrael ducu i ngegi, ma giromo dano alip abiro.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Lwak gumol gukato woko ki i dyeceng, kun Ben-adad tye mere kamato kongo ma omer ki kongo i bolo bedone, en kacel ki luker pyere adek wiye aryonu ma gucoke kakonyeni. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Lukony pa ludito ma giloyo dul lobo ducu gin aye gukwongo kato woko. Ben-adad ocwalo lurot piny ci nen gudwoko lok ni, “Lwak dano gitye kamol gikato woko ki i Camaria.” <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Ci rwot ogamo doggi ni, “Kace gubino pi yubu lok me kuc, ci wumakgi amaka makwo; kadi bed gubino kalweny bene wumakgi makwo.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Lukony pa ludito ma giloyo dul lobo gumol woko ducu ki i taun madit, ci lwak mony gulubu korgi. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Dano acel acel oneko dano mukemo nyime. Ci jo Ciria gucako ringo woko, kun jo Icrael giryemo korgi; ento Ben-adad rwot me Ciria obwot mere, pien oringo woko ki aguragura kacel ki wegi aguragura mogo. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Ci rwot me Icrael okato woko, omako lwak aguragura ki gadigadi lweny mapol, kun neko jo Ciria ki nek madit tutwal.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Ka lanebi dok obino bot rwot Akab me Icrael ci owaco bote ni, “Ber imed monyi obed matek, kun nongo bene itamo maber pi gin ma myero i tim ikare meno, pien jo Ciria dok gibidwogo cen i dog oro kacako lweny ikomi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Ciria gudwogo kalweny ki jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Lutic pa rwot me Ciria guwaco bote ni, “Jo man lubangagi lubanga me wi godi, omiyo gin yam gubedo tek, ci guloyowa; ento wek kong dok walweny kwedgi ki i dye bar, ci wan aye wabibedo tek makatogi. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Wamiyi ryeko kit man: kwany luker ducu woko ki i katicgi, wek iket ludito maloyo mony ma kakagi. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Dok iywa mony mukene marom ki mony ma dong kityekogi wokoni. Cok aguragura ki gadigadi lweny ma welgi rom ki macon ca, ci wek dong walweny ki jo Icrael i dye bar, ci wabibedo tek makatogi.” En owinyo doggi, ci otiyo kit ma guwaconi.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Ci Ben-adad ocoko mony pa jo Ciria i dog oro, ci gutiro i Apek pi lweny ki jo Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Jo Icrael bene guyube woko ki camgi ci gucito guryeyo monygi pi lweny ikom jo Ciria. Jo Icrael gugony inyim lumerokgi ma ginen calo dul dyegi manok ma kipokogi i dul aryo keken, ento jo Ciria gupongo bar woko liweng. <verse eid="1KI 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Dano pa Lubanga dok obino ci owaco bot rwot Akab me Icrael ni, “Rwot dok owaco kuman ni, ‘Pien jo Ciria gubedo kawaconi, Rwot en lubanga me godi, pe lubanga me notagu,’ en aye lok ma omiyo abimiyo monygi maditi woko i cingi kun ibiloyogi, ci in i bingeyo atir ni an aye a Rwot.” <verse eid="1KI 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Mony aryonu ducu gugony gukeme ki mony pa lumerokgi pi nino abiro kulu, ci lweny ocake inino me abirone. Ci jo Icrael guneko mony pa jo Ciria ma giwoto ki tyen gi maromo alip miya acel kulu ikom nino acelu. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Jo mudonge guringo gularo taun madit ma i Apek, ci cel ma orumu taun madit dok opoto ikom jo mapol ma gudonge ma giromo alip pyere aryo wiye abiro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:30">Ben-adad bene oringo ki kunu, odonyo wa i kicika ma i tyelo ot mo matye i taun madit meno. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />I nge lok man ma otime lutice guwace ni, “Nen ba, watyeko winyone ni luker ma i ot ker me Icrael gin ducu lukica. Wek kong waruk bongo cola i pyerwa ki latolgu ma watweyo iwiwa wacit kwede bot rwot me lobo Icrael, ci gwok nyo en pe bineki.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Ci gutweyo pyergi ki bongo cola, ki tol iwigi ducu, ci gucito kwede bot rwot me Icrael, ka guwaco bote ni, “Latici Ben-adad owaco ni, e bako doge boti ber i weke makwo, pe dong i neke.” Ci rwot me Icrael ogamo doggi ni, “En pud tye makwo bo? En tye calo omera.” <verse eid="1KI 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Onongo jonu gitye kayenyo lanyut mo ma weko giniang kit ma pinye tye kwede. Ka guwinyo nying man ni, “omera”, ci gugamo oyotoyot ni, “Eyo, omeru Ben-adad.” Akab dok owaco ni, “Wucit wukele.” Ben-adad obino bote, ci rwot Akab otinge i gadigadine.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Ci Ben-adad owaco bote ni nen, “Taun mayam wora oyakogi ki bot woru abidwokogi ducu i cingi: ka dok in bene i twero bedo ki ot cato wil i Damaciko kit mayam wora obedo kwede i Camaria.” Akab ogamo ni, “Abibwoti i cito pi lok man ma i cikoni.” Kitmeno oketo gicike kwede, ci obwote ocito.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanebi mo ojuku Akab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Laco mo ma ikin lwak pa lunebi owaco bot lawote ni, “Amito kong igoya malit,” kun Rwot aye onongo ociko en kumeno. Ento lawote okwero goye. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:24">1 Luk 13:24</ref></char></note>Ka dok owace ni, “In pe i woro lok dog Rwot. Pimeno, nen ba, kace i bia ki bota kombedi, labwor mo bineki woko cut.” Ka dano meno oa woko ki bote, ci labwor mo orwate kwede, ci okaye oneke woko cut. <verse eid="1KI 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Ci Lanebi acelu dok onongo dano mukene, ci owaco bote ni, “Amito ni kong i goya malit,” ci laco meno otugi goye cut, ogoye ma oketo ret ikome bene. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Lanebinu ocito, obedo kakuru rwot Akab inget yoo, kun oloko kit makome nen kwede pi umu wange woko ki kitambara ma otweyo i ye. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Ka rwot tye kakato en woko, ci en odange bote kun waco ni, “An latici acito i mony, ci adonyo wa idyere kama lweny tye malyet iye. Ci nen, acikari mo odwogo ki dano mo ma okelo bota ci ocika ni, ‘Gwoka dano man. Kace iweko orwenyo woko pi tyen lok mo, ci in aye i bito ma kakare, nyo i biculu pire ki talanta acel me ryal.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Kitmeno, pien onongo abedo ki longe mapol, ladit, omiyo danonu olwi ocito gire woko.” Ci rwot me Icrael owace ni, “Kibingoli kop kitmeno; in kikomi aye ityeko ngolone.” <verse eid="1KI 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Ka danonu okwanyo kitambara woko oyotoyot ki i wange, ci rwot otugi ngeyone cut ni en ngat acel ikin lunebi. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Danonu ma oboyo wangeni owaco bot rwot ni, “Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, pien in ityeko bwoto dano ma onongo an aciko ni myero kinek woko, pieno kibineko in me kakare, kibineko lwaki bene ma ka lwake.” <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Ci rwot me Icrael odok gang, oo i Camaria ki toncwiny ma wange bene obale woko.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Akab omayo poto olok pa Nabot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Nabot me Jejreel ceng tye ki poto oloke i Jejreel inget cel pa Akab ma rwot me Camaria. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Inino mo acel, Akab openyo Nabot ni, “Ber i miya poto oloki obed mera, wek apit iye pot deka, pien tye cok ki oda; ci abimiyi poto olok mukene me kakare, maber makato meno, nyo kace imito bene abiculu wele ki lim.” <verse eid="1KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Ento Nabot ogamo dog Akab ni, “Pe twere man obedo ginaleyana ma alimo; dong Rwot Lubanga pe twero ye ni amii lobo pa kwariwa woko boti.” <verse eid="1KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Ci Akab odok i ode ki kiniga ma wange obale woko pi lok ma Nabot me Jejreel owaco boteni; pien Nabot onongo odok iye bote ni pe ebimiyo lobo ma eleyo ki bot kwarine. Ci rwot Akab ocito obutu piny iwi kitandane kun oloko wange neno woko, kun pe ocamo wa cam mo bene.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Ento ka dakone Jejebel obino bote, ci openye ni, “Cwinyi ton pi tyen lok ango ma ogengi wa cam woko ni?” <verse eid="1KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Ci Akab otite ni, “Pien nakanen aloko ki Nabot me Jejreel kun apenye ni omiya poto oloke wek awil ki lim, nyo kono ka en mito ci abimiye poto olok mukene me kakare. Ci en okwero woko, owaco ni pe ebimiya poto oloke.” <verse eid="1KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Ci dakone Jejebel ogamo ni, “Pe in aye i loyo Icrael kombedi bo? A malo i cam, wek cwinyi obed mayom. An aye dong abimiyi poto olok pa Nabot me Jejreel.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Ci Jejebel ocoyo waraga ki nying Akab, ma omwono woko kun odiyo agit pa Akab ikom odok; ci ocwalo waraga man bot jo ma ludongo ki ludito mukene ma gibedo ki Nabot i taun madit me Jejreel. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Waragane onongo kicoyo kit man ni, “Wucik pi kare me rii kec, ci wucib Nabot obed iwi kom me dito ikin lwak. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Ka dong wukel lutim aranyi aryo gucung kunu kun gikemo nyime atir, ci wek gukel kop ikome kun gin waco ni, ‘In i ceno Lubanga ki rwot.’ Ka dong wutere woko, ci wucele ki got wuneke woko.” <verse eid="1KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Ci jonu ma i dog taun madit meno, ludongo ki lutela mukene ma gibedo i taun maditi, gutimo kit ma Jejebel ocwalo kwede lok botgi. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Guciko kare me rii kec, ka guketo Nabot iwi kom me dito ikin lwak. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Ci lubwami aryo gubino gucung gukemo nyime. Gukelo kop ikom Nabot ki inyim lwak ducu kun giwaco ni, “Nabot oceno Lubanga ki rwot Akab bene.” Ka gutere woko inge taun madit, ci gucele ki got guneke woko. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Ka gucwalo kwena bot Jejebel pi tite ni, “Nabot dong kityeko celone woko ki got; dok bene oto.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Ka Jejebel owinyo ni Nabot dong kicelo woko ki got kineko woko, ci owaco bot Akab ni, “A malo, icam poto olok pa Nabot me Jejreel, mayam okwero miyone boti wek iwil ki limi; kombedi Nabot dong peke, en dong oto woko.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ka Akab owinyo ni Nabot dong oto woko, ci en oa malo ocito i poto olok pa Nabot i Jejreel kacamone woko cut.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Ci Rwot Lubanga oloko ki Eliya ma Laticbe ma waco ni, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“A malo, icit irwate ki Akab rwot me Icrael matye i Camaria. Nen, en kombedi tye i poto olok pa Nabot. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:38">1 Luk 22:38</ref></char></note>Ibiwaco bote ni Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, ‘Ineko dano woko ka dok icamo wa poto ne bene?’ Dok ibiwace ni, ‘I kabedo kama gwogi gunango i ye remo pa Nabot, en aye in bene gwogi binango i ye remoni.’”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Akab owaco bot Eliya ni, “Man dong i nonga woko do, in ma lamerokani?” Eliya ogamo ni, “An dong anongi, pien in aye imiyo komi kekeni pi tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Nen, abikelo can ikomi; abityeko in ki luoti ma co woko liweng, abineko jo ducu woko matye bot in Akab, kacel ki opiini wa ki anywali matye bot in i lobo Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Abimiyo odi bedo calo ot pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, marom bene ki ot pa Baaca wod pa Akija, pi kiniga ma imiyo omaka, dok pien imiyo jo Icrael gubalo. <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:36">2 Luk 9:36</ref></char></note>Dok Rwot owaco lok ikom Jejebel bene kit man ni, ‘Gwogi aye bimwodo kom Jejebel woko ki i lobo ma inget Jejreel.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Dano ma wat pa Akab ma oto i gang, gwogi aye bimwodo komgi, ento dano ma gibito i dye tim ata, winyo aye bicamogi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />(Pe tye dano mo mayam omiyo kome kekene pi tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot macalo Akab, ma dakone Jejebel odiye i ye ki tek. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />En otimo bal me kipyeda marac tutwal pi lubu kor jogigu, macalo jo Amor yam gutimo, ma Rwot oryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael.)<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Ka Akab owinyo lok meno, ci oyeco bongine woko, oruku bongo cola cut ikome, obedo kawot ma kun cwinye odem woko.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Lok pa Rwot dok obino bot Eliya ma Laticbe ma waco bote ni, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“In mono ineno kit ma Akab obedo kwede ka mwole inyima? Pien en dong omwole kene inyima, pe abikelo can i karene kikome; ento ikare pa wode aye abikelo can ikom jo me ode.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Lanebi Mikaya ociko Akab i nying Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2 Tek 18:2-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Jo Ciria ki jo Icrael gubedo mot labongo lweny mo ikin gi pi mwaka maromo adek. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Ento i mwaka me adeke Yekocapat rwot me Juda ocito kalimo rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Ci rwot Akab me Icrael owaco lok man bot lutice ni, “Wun mono tika wungeyo ni Ramot-gilead mewa? Wan waling woko ata, pingo pe dong kong wacitu wek wamayu woko ki i cing rwot me Ciria?” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Ka dok oloke openyo Yekocapat ni, “In mono bene ibicito kwedwa kalweny ikom gang me Ramot-gilead?” Ci Yekocapat ogamo dog Akab ma en rwot me Icrael kun wace ni, “An ki in wan acel. Lwaka aye lwaki, ki aguragurana aye aguragurani bene.”<verse eid="1KI 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Ka dok Yekocapat owaco bot rwot me Icrael ni, “Kong i kwong penyo lok ki bot Rwot wek wawiny doge.” <verse eid="1KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Ka rwot Akab ocoko lwak lunebi ducu kacel ma gin gucoke onongo tye romo miya angwen. Ci owaco botgi ni, “Acit kalweny ikom Ramot-gilead, nyo pe?” Lunebinu gugamo ni, “Tugi cito cut rwot, pien Rwot Lubanga obimiyo i cingi.” <verse eid="1KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Ento Yekocapat dok owaco ni, “Lanebi mo mukene pa Rwot Lubanga peke kany? Wek kong dok wapeny doge?” <verse eid="1KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Ci rwot me Icrael ogamo dog Yekocapat ni, “Pud tye dano mo acel ma omyero wapenye wek wawiny dog Rwot ki bote, en aye Mikaya wod pa Imla; ento cwinya dage matek, pien peya otita kit lok mo maber, en tiko tita lok marace keken.” Ka Yekocapat ocako ogamo doge ni, “Pe kumeno, rwot, wek lok kitmeno obedi.” <verse eid="1KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Ci rwot me Icrael olwongo ladit mo ci owaco bote ni, “Cit i kel Mikaya wod pa Imla oyotoyot.” <verse eid="1KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Ci en obino onongo Akab rwot me Icrael ki Yekocapat rwot me Juda gubedo iwi komkergi ma guruku jor kergi mabeco; gubedo kwede i laro moyo me dino ngano ma inget dogcel ma ki donyo kwede i Camaria, kun lunebi ducu gitye katito ki tucu lok inyimgi. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Jedekia wod pa Kenaana oyubu cal tung lee ki nyonyo ci owaco ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, in i bitwomo jo Ciria kit man macalo dyang twomo wadi ki tunge, nio ka i tyekogi woko ducu.” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Lunebinu ducu ma gitye gutito lok ma kite acelu kumeno kun giwaco ni, “Tugi cito i Ramot-gilead rwot pien i biloyo; Rwot bimiyo i cingi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Lakwena ma ocito kalwongo Mikaya ni obino ci owace ni, “Nen ba, Mikaya, lok pa lunebi magi ducu obedo me cuku cwiny rwot; pieno wek loki bene obed marom ki meggi, loki bene obed lok me cuku cwiny.” <verse eid="1KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Ci Mikaya ogamo doge ni, “Akwongo kwong inying Rwot matye makwoni, ni gin ducu ma Rwot owaca, en aye abilokone.” <verse eid="1KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Ka Mikaya oo bot rwot, ci rwot openye ni, “Wacit kalweny ikom Ramot-gilead, nyo pe?” Ci Mikaya ogamo ni, “Tugi cito cut, ci ibiloyo; Rwot bimiyo i cingi, rwot.” <verse eid="1KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Ento rwot Akab dok owaco bote ni, “An mono abiciki i nying Lubanga tyen adi ni i loka lok me ada keken i nying Rwot?” <verse eid="1KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Wel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note>Ci Mikaya ocako waco ni, “Aneno jo Icrael ducu guket woko lijayi iwi godi, macalo romi ma gipeke ki lakwat mo. Dok Rwot bene owaco ni, ‘Joni laditgi peke; wek ngat acel acel odok gire i pacone ki kuc.’”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Ci rwot Akab me Icrael ocako waco bot Yekocapat ni, “An pe onongo con awaco ki ni, Mikaya pe bitito lok mo maber ma otika, ento bitito marace?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:1">Ica 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yub 1:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ci Mikaya ogamo doge ni, “Pimeno kong dong iwiny lok ma Rwot dok tye kamede ki titone mono. An Mikaya, abedo kaneno Rwot ka tye ma obedo iwi komkere, kun lwak mony me polo ducu gucung kangete tung bade ma lacuc ki tung bade ma lacam. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Ci Rwot owaco ni. ‘Anga mono ma bibito Akab, wek ocit oto i Ramot-gilead?’ Ci lumalaika me polo gubedo kun giwaco lok mapatpat. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Ka lacen kit cwiny mo obino, okati anyim ci ocung inyim Rwot kun waco ni, ‘An aye abibito en.’ <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Rwot openye ni, ‘Ibibito en ningning?’ Ci cwiny meno ogamo ni, ‘Abicito ci abibedo cwiny ma lagoba kun aloko ki i dog lunebine ducu.’ Ci Rwot ogamo ni ‘In ibibito en, ci en biye loki. Dong icit i tim kumeno.’ <verse eid="1KI 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />Kombedi dong otyeko nen kamaleng ni Rwot dong otyeko keto cwiny ma lagoba i dog lunebini magi ducu; dok Rwot bene dong otyeko ciko pi kelo gin marac ikomi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Ci Jedekia wod pa Kenaana ocito bot Mikaya cok, ci otugi dongo leme, ci owace ni, “Cwiny Rwot dok oa ki ikoma ningning ka okobo oloko boti?” <verse eid="1KI 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya owace ni, “Meno i biniang iye inino ma i bidonyo i kicika ma i tyelo wek ikane iye.” <verse eid="1KI 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Ci Rwot Akab me Icrael dok owaco ni, “Wumak Mikaya woko, wudwoke cen bot Amon ma laloyo me taun madit, ki bot Yoaci ma wod pa rwot. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Kun icit iwac botgi ni, ‘rwot Akab owaco kuman ni, wuket dano man i buc, dok wumiye ocam cam me buc, mugati ki pii keken, nio ka abidwogo paco ki kuc.’”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Ci Mikaya ogamo loke ni, “Kace i dwogo paco ki kuc, ci pe Rwot aye oloko ki idoga.” Dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Wun rok ducu dong wuwiny lok man ma atitoni maber!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Akab rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Tek 18:28-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Kitmeno rwot Akab me Icrael ki Yekocapat rwot me Juda gucito i Ramot-gilead. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Ka lacen rwot me Icrael owaco bot Yekocapat ni, “An abiruke macalo dano mo ata ka dong acito kalweny, ento in i ruk jori me ker.” Ci rwot Akab me Icrael oruke macalo dano mo ata, ka ocito kwede i dog lweny. <verse eid="1KI 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Ikare meno onongo dong rwot me Ciria otyeko ciko ludito mony pyere adek wiye aryo ma giloyo gadigadine me lweny ni, “Pe wulweny ki dano mo matidi nyo madit, kono rwot me Icrael keken.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Ka ludito mony guneno Yekocapat, guwaco ni, “Meno aye rwot me Icrael kikome.” Ci guloke kalweny ikome, ci Yekocapat ocako dange ki mwoc. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Ka ludito mony me gadigadi lweny guniang ni pe en rwot me Icrael, ci guloke gudok woko cen gubwoto lubu kore. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Ento dano mo otelo atume ocelo ata, ci ocelo kwede rwot me Icrael atura. Atero obaro kin nyonyo me gengo kore ki nyonyo mukene me gengo kome ma obedo macalo pok rec. Ka rwot owaco bot laryem gadigadine ni, “Loke wadok cen wek ikwanya woko ki iwang lweny, pien ret otyeko maka woko.” <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Lweny omede odoko malyet ada inino meno, dok lutic pa Akab gubedo kajengo kome i gadigadine kun wange okemo jo Ciria nio wa otyeno, ka oto. Remo me wang rete omol piny ite gadigadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Ikare ma ceng dong cok poto, dano gucako dange kun dwon gi oromo dye mony ducu ni, “Dano acel acel odok i taun madite. Dano acel acel odok wa i lobone!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Rwot Akab oto kitmeno, ci kitero kome i Camaria, ci kiyiko kunu. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Gulwoko kom gadigadine i kut me Camaria, kama lukwele gilwoke i ye, ci gwogi gunango remone, kit ma Rwot con owaconi. <verse eid="1KI 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Lok kom Akab mudonge ducu, ki gin ducu ma en otiyo, ki ot ma en ogero ma odeyo ki lak lyec, ki lwak taun madito ducu ma en ogero, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Kitmeno Akab oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine. Wode Akajia aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yekocapat rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2 Tek 20:31—21:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Yekocapat wod pa Aca ocako loyo jo Juda i mwaka me angwen me loc pa Akab rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yekocapat ocamo ker ma onongo mwaka me dite romo pyere adek wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye abic. Nying mine Ajuba ma nya pa Cilki. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Yekocapat obedo kalubu kit pa wone Aca ducu; pe oloke oweko lubu kore. En obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot. Ento wang jogi ma iwi godi pe kimukugi woko; dano pud gubedo ka tyero gitumgi iwang jogi, dok gubedo kawango iye odok eceta. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Yekocapat oketo kuc bene ikin en ki rwot me Icrael.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Lok kom Yekocapat mudonge ducu, ki teke, ki kit ma olwenyo kwede kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Juda. </char> <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Co wa ki mon ma lutim tim kwele iwang jogi mayam pud odong ikare pa wone Aca, en ojwayo ticgi woko ki i lobone.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Ikare ca onongo rwot pe i Edom. Lawang rwot me Juda aye obedo macalo rwotgi.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Yekocapat omiyo kipayo lwak mel ma dongo me cito i Opir pi omo jabugu; ento pe gucito, pien mel ducu gutur woko ki i Ejion-geber. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Lacen Akajia wod pa Akab owaco bot Yekocapat ni, “Wek lutica gucit kacel ki lutici i meli,” ento Yekocapat okwero meno gire woko.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Yekocapat oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa Daudi. Wode Jekoram aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Akajia rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Akajia wod pa Akab ocako loyo jo Icrael ki i Camaria i mwaka me apar wiye abiro me loc pa Yekocapat rwot me Juda, ci obedo kaloyo jo Icrael pi mwaka aryo. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun bedo kalubu kit pa wone ki kit pa minne, ki kit pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, mayam omiyo jo Icrael gubalo. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />En bene obedo ka woro jok Baal, kun bene tiyo bote, dok man omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga me Icrael malube ki kit tic ducu mayam wone otiyo kwede.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>